70U8","text":"The form asks about the patient's ability to walk from one room to another, maneuver around furniture, and navigate other obstacles indoors. The label classifies the patient's performance as most dependent.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0175C8","prefix":"GG0175C8","text":"Once the patient is seated in the wheelchair, they should have the ability to wheel at least 150 feet in a corridor or similar space. The choices for this ability are with a manual wheelchair or indicating the most dependent performance.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0185F8","prefix":"GG0185F8","text":"The form asks about the patient's ability to answer a telephone call in their customary manner and maintain it for 1 minute or longer. This does not include getting to the phone. The label for the most dependent performance is used.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0185K7","prefix":"GG0185K7","text":"The patient's usual performance in simple financial management includes the ability to complete financial transactions such as counting coins, verifying change for a single item transaction, writing a check, online/mobile bill pay, banking, or shopping.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/modera