his activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170C8","prefix":"GG0170C8","text":"The form is asking about the patient's ability to move from lying on their back to sitting on the side of the bed with their feet flat on the floor, without any back support. The patient's performance in this task is categorized as 'Most Dependent'.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0175J7","prefix":"GG0175J7","text":"The form asks the patient about their ability to wheel across a street before the light turns red once they are seated in a wheelchair or scooter. The options for response are 'Motorized Wheelchair/Scooter' and 'Usual Performance'.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0185D7","prefix":"GG0185D7","text":"The patient's usual performance in the ability to complete heavier periodic housework, such as doing laundry, vacuuming, and cleaning the bathroom, is evaluated to ensure they can maintain a safe home environment and not be at risk for harm within their home.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not