tance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0175G7","prefix":"GG0175G7","text":"Once the patient is seated in a wheelchair or scooter, they should have the ability to wheel at least 50 feet and make two turns. The options are either using a motorized wheelchair/scooter or executing their usual performance.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170O7","prefix":"GG0170O7","text":"The patient's usual performance is their ability to go up and down 12 steps with or without a rail.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0175D8","prefix":"GG0175D8","text":"The patient's ability to wheel for 15 minutes once seated in a manual wheelchair, without stopping or resting, for example, through a department store or supermarket, is evaluated as the most dependent performance.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0185H8","prefix":"GG0185H8","text":"The form is asking about the patient's ability to manage their oral medications. This involves the preparation and safely taking all prescribed oral medications, including the administration of the correct dosage at the appropriate times/intervals. The level of performance is marked as \"most dependent\".","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0125F","prefix":"GG0125F","text":"Does the patient use an assistive device such as a mechanical lift?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Assistive device needed and available - {Patient/Resident} needs this device to complete daily activities and has the device in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30918-9","display":"Assistive device needed and available - Person needs this device to complete daily activities and has the device in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Assistive device needed but current device unsuitable - Device is in home but no longer meets {patient's/resident's} needs."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30919-7","display":"Assistive device needed but current device unsuitable - Device is in home but no longer meets person's needs."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"00","display":"Assistive device needed but not available - {Patient/Resident} needs the device but it is not available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30920-5","display":"Assistive device needed but not available - Person needs the device but it is not available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused - {Patient/Resident} chooses not to use needed device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30921-3","display":"Person refused - Person chooses to not use needed device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not need this device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30922-1","display":"Not applicable - Person does not need this device."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0175D7","prefix":"GG0175D7","text":"The form asks if the patient has the ability to wheel without stopping or resting for 15 minutes once seated in a manual wheelchair, such as when navigating through a department store or supermarket. The question is about their usual performance.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170G8","prefix":"GG0170G8","text":"The form asks about the patient's ability to transfer in and out of a car or van on the passenger side. This does not include the ability to open or close the door or fasten the seat belt. The patient's performance in this area is most dependent.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170I8","prefix":"GG0170I8","text":"The form asks about the patient's ability to walk at least 10 feet once they are standing, whether it be in a room, corridor, or a similar space. The patient's performance is rated as \"Most Dependent\".","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0180B","prefix":"GG0180B","text":"Please ask the patient to describe at least one or two personal priorities in the area of mobility for the next six months. If the patient does not express any personal priorities in this area, please note this below.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1500},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130A7","prefix":"GG0130A7","text":"The form is asking about the patient's usual performance in eating. It refers to their ability to use suitable utensils to bring food and/or liquid to their mouth and swallow food and/or liquid once the meal is placed before them.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0185G8","prefix":"GG0185G8","text":"The form asks about the patient's or resident's ability to place a call in their customary manner and maintain it for 1 minute or longer. It does not include getting to the phone. The patient's performance in this area is classified as 'Most Dependent'.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0175E8","prefix":"GG0175E8","text":"The form asks about the patient's ability to wheel across a street once seated in a wheelchair before the light turns red. The options are from most dependent to a manual wheelchair performance.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0185B7","prefix":"GG0185B7","text":"The form asks whether the patient has the ability to plan and prepare all aspects of a light hot meal, such as heating a bowl of soup and reheating a prepared meal. The label for this question is referring to the patient's usual performance.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0125L","prefix":"GG0125L","text":"Does the patient use an assistive device such as grab bars?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Assistive device needed and available - {Patient/Resident} needs this device to complete daily activities and has the device in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30918-9","display":"Assistive device needed and available - Person needs this device to complete daily activities and has the device in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Assistive device needed but current device unsuitable - Device is in home but no longer meets {patient's/resident's} needs."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30919-7","display":"Assistive device needed but current device unsuitable - Device is in home but no longer meets person's needs."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"00","display":"Assistive device needed but not available - {Patient/Resident} needs the device but it is not available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30920-5","display":"Assistive device needed but not available - Person needs the device but it is not available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused - {Patient/Resident} chooses not to use needed device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30921-3","display":"Person refused - Person chooses to not use needed device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not need this device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30922-1","display":"Not applicable - Person does not need this device."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-6/F0905B","prefix":"F0905B","text":"Please ask the patient to describe at least one or two personal priorities in the area of living arrangements for the next six months. If the patient does not express any personal priorities in this area, kindly note this down.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1500},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170U7","prefix":"GG0170U7","text":"The form asks about the patient's usual performance in their ability to walk indoors, specifically from room to room, and around furniture and other obstacles.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0185E7","prefix":"GG0185E7","text":"The form asks about the patient's usual performance in light shopping tasks. Specifically, it asks if the patient can once at the store locate and select up to five needed goods, take them to the checkout, and complete the purchasing transaction.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170P8","prefix":"GG0170P8","text":"The form inquires about the patient's ability to bend or stoop from a standing position to pick up a small object, such as a spoon, from the floor. The performance level selected for the patient is \"Most Dependent Performance\".","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"s