{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0125M","prefix":"GG0125M","text":"Does the patient use an assistive device such as a transfer board?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Assistive device needed and available - {Patient/Resident} needs this device to complete daily activities and has the device in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30918-9","display":"Assistive device needed and available - Person needs this device to complete daily activities and has the device in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Assistive device needed but current device unsuitable - Device is in home but no longer meets {patient's/resident's} needs."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30919-7","display":"Assistive device needed but current device unsuitable - Device is in home but no longer meets person's needs."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"00","display":"Assistive device needed but not available - {Patient/Resident} needs the device but it is not available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30920-5","display":"Assistive device needed but not available - Person needs the device but it is not available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused - {Patient/Resident} chooses not to use needed device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30921-3","display":"Person refused - Person chooses to not use needed device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not need this device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30922-1","display":"Not applicable - Person does not need this device."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130B8","prefix":"GG0130B8","text":"The form asks about the patient's ability to maintain oral hygiene by using suitable items to clean their teeth and, if applicable, their ability to insert and remove dentures into and from their mouth, as well as manage denture soaking and rinsing with the use of equipment. The response category for their performance is \"Most Dependent\".","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0125S","prefix":"GG0125S","text":"The patient uses an assistive device, specifically stair rails.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Assistive device needed and available - {Patient/Resident} needs this device to complete daily activities and has the device in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30918-9","display":"Assistive device needed and available - Person needs this device to complete daily activities and has the device in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Assistive device needed but current device unsuitable - Device is in home but no longer meets {patient's/resident's} needs."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30919-7","display":"Assistive device needed but current device unsuitable - Device is in home but no longer meets person's needs."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"00","display":"Assistive device needed but not available - {Patient/Resident} needs the device but it is not available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30920-5","display":"Assistive device needed but not available - Person needs the device but it is not available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused - {Patient/Resident} chooses not to use needed device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30921-3","display":"Person refused - Person chooses to not use needed device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not need this device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30922-1","display":"Not applicable - Person does not need this device."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0135B","prefix":"GG0135B","text":"Please ask the patient to describe at least one or two personal priorities in the area of self-care for the next six months. If the patient does not express any personal priorities in this area, please record this information below.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1500},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170P7","prefix":"GG0170P7","text":"The form asks about the patient's usual performance in the ability to bend or stoop from a standing position to pick up a small object, such as a spoon, from the floor.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","c