/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0190A","prefix":"GG0190A","text":"Please ask the patient to describe at least one or two personal priorities in the area of instrumental activities of daily living for the next six months. If the patient does not express any personal priorities in this area, please note this below. Answer: A","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1500},{"linkId":"Section-6/F0905A","prefix":"F0905A","text":"Please ask the patient to describe at least one or two personal priorities in the area of their living arrangements for the next six months. If the patient does not express any personal priorities in this area, please note this below. The options are - A.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1500},{"linkId":"Section-6/F0920B1","prefix":"F0920B1","text":"Does the patient require mobility assistance, such as assistance with bed mobility, transfers, ambulating, or wheeling? If yes, is this assistance paid?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Assistance not needed - No assistance needed."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30938-7","display":"Assistance not needed - No assistance needed."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Caregiver(s) currently provide assistance - {Patient's/Resident's} usual caregiver(s) willing and able to provide needed assistance."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30939-5","display":"Caregiver(s) currently provide assistance - Person's usual caregiver(s) willing and able to provide needed assistance."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Caregiver(s) need training/supportive services to provide assistance - Caregiver(s) available and need assistance to provide support."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30940-3","display":"Caregiver(s) need training/supportive services to provide assistance - Caregiver(s) available and need assistance to provide support."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Unclear is caregiver(s) will provide assistance - Caregiver(s) available in the home but it is not clear if caregiver(s) will provide needed assistance."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30941-1","display":"Unclear if caregiver(s) will provide assistance - Caregiver(s) available in the home but it is not clear if caregiver(s) will provide needed assistance."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Assistance needed but no caregiver(s) available - {Patient/Resident} needs assistance but no caregiver(s) available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30942-9","display":"Assistance needed but no caregiver(s) available - Person needs assistance but no caregiver(s) available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"00","display":"Assistance needed but {patient/resident} declines assistance - {Patient/Resident} needs caregiving but declines this assistance."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30943-7","display":"Assistance needed but person declines assistance - Person needs caregiving but declines this assistance."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30944-5","display":"Not applicable - Person does not do this activity."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0185L8","prefix":"GG0185L8","text":"The form indicates the patient's level of ability in complex financial management, such as completing financial decision-making tasks including budgeting and remembering to pay bills. The patient's performance is recorded as mostly dependent.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contac