t - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-6/F0920H1","prefix":"F0920H1","text":"Does the individual advocate or facilitate the patient's participation in appropriate medical care, for example, providing transportation to or from appointments? The options for this are either paid or unpaid.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Assistance not needed - No assistance needed."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30938-7","display":"Assistance not needed - No assistance needed."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Caregiver(s) currently provide assistance - {Patient's/Resident's} usual caregiver(s) willing and able to provide needed assistance."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30939-5","display":"Caregiver(s) currently provide assistance - Person's usual caregiver(s) willing and able to provide needed assistance."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Caregiver(s) need training/supportive services to provide assistance - Caregiver(s) available and need assistance to provide support."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30940-3","display":"Caregiver(s) need training/supportive services to provide assistance - Caregiver(s) available and need assistance to provide support."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Unclear is caregiver(s) will provide assistance - Caregiver(s) available in the home but it is not clear if caregiver(s) will provide needed assistance."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30941-1","display":"Unclear if caregiver(s) will provide assistance - Caregiver(s) available in the home but it is not clear if caregiver(s) will provide needed assistance."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Assistance needed but no caregiver(s) available - {Patient/Resident} needs assistance but no caregiver(s) available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30942-9","display":"Assistance needed but no caregiver(s) available - Person needs assistance but no caregiver(s) available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"00","display":"Assistance needed but {patient/resident} declines assistance - {Patient/Resident} needs caregiving but declines this assistance."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30943-7","display":"Assistance needed but person declines assistance - Person needs caregiving but declines this assistance."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30944-5","display":"Not applicable - Person does not do this activity."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170M7","prefix":"GG0170M7","text":"The form asks about the patient's usual performance in the ability to go up and down a curb and/or up and down one step.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the 