s. It asks for information about their usual performance.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0125U","prefix":"GG0125U","text":"Does the patient use an assistive device such as ramps?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Assistive device needed and available - {Patient/Resident} needs this device to complete daily activities and has the device in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30918-9","display":"Assistive device needed and available - Person needs this device to complete daily activities and has the device in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Assistive device needed but current device unsuitable - Device is in home but no longer meets {patient's/resident's} needs."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30919-7","display":"Assistive device needed but current device unsuitable - Device is in home but no longer meets person's needs."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"00","display":"Assistive device needed but not available - {Patient/Resident} needs the device but it is not available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30920-5","display":"Assistive device needed but not available - Person needs the device but it is not available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused - {Patient/Resident} chooses not to use needed device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30921-3","display":"Person refused - Person chooses to not use needed device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not need this device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30922-1","display":"Not applicable - Person does not need this device."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0180A","prefix":"GG0180A","text":"Please ask the patient to describe at least one or two personal priorities in the area of mobility for the next six months. If the patient does not express any personal priorities in this area, please note this below. The answer options would be: A) Improvement in walking, B) Ability to climb stairs, C) Independence in moving, or D) No personal priorities.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1500},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0135A","prefix":"GG0135A","text":"Please ask the patient to describe at least one or two personal priorities in the area of self-care for the next six months. If the patient does not express any personal priorities in this area, please note this in their record.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1500},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0125K","prefix":"GG0125K","text":"Does the patient use an assistive device such as an electronic bed?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Assistive device needed and available - {Patient/Resident} needs this device to complete daily activities and has the device in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30918-9","display":"Assistive device needed and available - Person needs this device to complete daily activities and has the device in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Assistive device needed but current device unsuitable - Device is in home but no longer meets {patient's/resident's} needs."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30919-7","display":"Assistive device needed but current device unsuitable - Device is in home but no longer meets person's needs."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"00","display":"Assistive device needed but not available - {Patient/Resident} needs the device but it is not available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30920-5","display":"Assistive device needed but not available - Person needs the device but it is not available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused - {Patient/Resident} chooses not to use needed device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30921-3","display":"Person refused - Person chooses to not use needed device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not need this device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30922-1","display":"Not applicable - Person does not need this device."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0125H","prefix":"GG0125H","text":"Does the patient use an assistive device such as a sock aid?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Assistive device needed and available - {Patient/Resident} needs this device to complete daily activities and has the device in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30918-9","display":"Assistive device needed and available - Person needs this device to complete daily activities and has the device in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Assistive device needed but current device unsuitable - Device is in home but no longer meets {patient's/resident's} needs."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30919-7","display":"Assistive device needed but current device unsuitable - Device is in home but no longer meets person's needs."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"00","display":"Assistive device needed but not available - {Patient/Resident} needs the device but it is not available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30920-5","display":"Assistive device needed but not available - Person needs the device but it is not available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused - {Patient/Resident} chooses not to use needed device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30921-3","display":"Person refused - Person chooses to not use needed device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not need this device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30922-1","display":"Not applicable - Person does not need this device."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-6/F0920C2","prefix":"F0920C2","text":"The patient requires assistance with Instrumental Activities of Daily Living (IADL), such as making meals, housekeeping, telephone, shopping, or finances, which is currently unpaid.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Assistance not needed - No assistance needed."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30938-7","display":"Assistance not needed - No assistance needed."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Caregiver(s) currently provide assistance - {Patient's/Resident's} usual caregiver(s) willing and able to provide needed assistance."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30939-5","display":"Caregiver(s) currently provide assistance - Person's usual caregiver(s) willing and able to provide needed assistance."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Caregiver(s) need training/supportive services to provide assistance - Caregiver(s) available and need assistance to provide support."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30940-3","display":"Caregiver(s) need training/supportive services to provide assistance - Caregiver(s) available and need assistance to provide support."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Unclear is caregiver(s) will provide assistance - Caregiver(s) available in the home but it is not clear if caregiver(s) will provide needed assistance."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30941-1","display":"Unclear if caregiver(s) will provide assistance - Caregiver(s) available in the home but it is not clear if caregiver(s) will provide needed assistance."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Assistance needed but no caregiver(s) available - {Patient/Resident} needs assistance but no caregiver(s) available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30942-9","display":"Assistance needed but no caregiver(s) available - Person needs assistance but no caregiver(s) available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"00","display":"Assistance needed but {patient/resident} declines assistance - {Patient/Resident} needs caregiving but declines this assistance."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30943-7","display":"Assistance needed but person declines assistance - Person needs caregiving but declines this assistance."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30944-5","display":"Not applicable - Person does not do this activity."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130A8","prefix":"GG0130A8","text":"The question on the form assesses the patient's ability to use suitable utensils to bring food and/or liquid to their mouth and swallow food and/or liquid once the meal is placed before them. The performance options range from independent to most dependent.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistanc