tem":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0185F7","prefix":"GG0185F7","text":"The form asks about the patient's ability to answer a telephone call in their customary manner and maintain the call for one minute or longer. It does not include getting to the phone. The question refers to the patient's usual performance.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0175I8","prefix":"GG0175I8","text":"The patient questionnaire asked, \"Once the patient is seated in a wheelchair or scooter, do they have the ability to wheel without stopping or resting for 15 minutes (for example, through a department store or supermarket)?\" The answer choices include \"Motorized Wheelchair/Scooter\" and \"Most Dependent Performance.\"","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0190B","prefix":"GG0190B","text":"Please ask the patient to describe at least one or two personal priorities in the area of instrumental activities of daily living for the next six months. If the patient does not express any personal priorities in this area, note it below.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1500},{"linkId":"Section-6/F0925A","prefix":"F0925A","text":"Please ask the patient to describe at least one or two personal priorities for their caregiving arrangement in the next six months. If the patient does not express any personal priorities in this area, please note this below.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1500},{"linkId":"Section-6/F0925B","prefix":"F0925B","text":"Please ask the patient or resident to describe at least one or two personal priorities in the area of caregiving for the next six months. If the patient or resident does not express any personal priorities in this area, please note this below. The options are:\n\nA. The patient expresses personal priorities in the area of caregiving.\nB. The patient does not express any personal priorities in the area of caregiving.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1500},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170V8","prefix":"GG0170V8","text":"The form for the patient asks about his or her ability to carry something in both hands while walking indoors, such as several dishes, a light laundry basket, or a tray with food. The patient's performance in this area is identified as most dependent.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]}],"_id":"iaiTYS7rRqnoovaWb"}
{"responseType":"QuestionnaireResponse","id":"his-ha-2.00.0","questionnaire":"HIS-HA-2.00.0","title":"Hospice Item Set - Hospice Admission Record","description":"The HIS is a standardized set of items intended to capture patient-level data on each hospice patient admission. HIS items can be used to calculate seven National Quality Forum (NQF) - endorsed measures, and two non-NQF endorsed measures.","status":"draft","authored":"2024-04-27T18:38:55.449Z","item":[{"linkId":"Section-36/A0700","prefix":"A0700","text":"The form asks for the patient's Medicaid number. The patient should enter \"+\" if their Medicaid status is pending, or \"N\" if they are not a Medicaid recipient.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":14},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0800","prefix":"A0800","text":"What is the patient's gender? The possible answers could be male, female, or prefer not to say.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0900","prefix":"A0900","text":"What is the patient's birth date?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0050","prefix":"A0050","text":"The type of record for the patient needs to be specified.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0250","prefix":"A0250","text":"The reason for the patient's assessment needs to be determined.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0220","prefix":"A0220","text":"What is the patient's admission date?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-36/A1802","prefix":"A1802","text":"Where was the patient immediately preceding this admission? Was the patient admitted from another hospital, a nursing home, their residence, or another location?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0550","prefix":"A0550","text":"What is the patient's ZIP code?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":11},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0100A","prefix":"A0100A","text":"Does the patient have a National Provider Identifier (NPI)?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":10},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0100B","prefix":"A0100B","text":"What is the patient's CMS Certification Number (CCN)?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500A","prefix":"A0500A","text":"What is the patient's first name?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500B","prefix":"A0500B","text":"What is the patient's middle initial?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500C","prefix":"A0500C","text":"What is the patient's last name?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":18},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500D","prefix":"A0500D","text":"The form asks for the patient's suffix.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":3},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0600A","prefix":"A0600A","text":"What is the patient's Social Security Number?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":9},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0600B","prefix":"A0600B","text":"What is the patient's Medicare number?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-36/A1000","prefix":"A1000","text":"The patient should check all the applicable boxes for their race or ethnicity.","type":"text","repeats":true,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A1400","prefix":"A1400","text":"The patient needs to fill out the payer information and must check all the options that apply to them.","type":"text","repeats":true,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0205","prefix":"A0205","text":"What was the site of service at the patient's admission?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0245","prefix":"A0245","text":"The date when the initial nursing assessment was initiated for the patient.","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2000A","prefix":"F2000A","text":"Was the patient, resident, or responsible party asked about their preference regarding the use of cardiopulmonary resuscitation (CPR)? Please select the most accurate response.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2000B","prefix":"F2000B","text":"The date on which the patient or responsible party was first asked about their preference regarding the use of CPR.","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2100A","prefix":"F2100A","text":"Was the patient, or their responsible party, asked about their preferences regarding life-sustaining treatments other than CPR? Select the most accurate response.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2100B","prefix":"F2100B","text":"What was the date when the patient or responsible party was first asked about their preferences regarding life-sustaining treatments other than CPR?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2200A","prefix":"F2200A","text":"Was the patient or the responsible party asked about their preference regarding hospitalization? Please select the most accurate response.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2200B","prefix":"F2200B","text":"The date when the patient, resident, or responsible party was first asked about their preference regarding hospitalization is:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-47/F3000A","prefix":"F3000A","text":"Was the patient or their caregiver asked about any spiritual or existential concerns? Please select the most accurate response.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-47/F3000B","prefix":"F3000B","text":"The date on which the patient or caregiver was first asked about spiritual or existential concerns is:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-9/I0010","prefix":"I0010","text":"What is the patient's principal diagnosis?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0900A","prefix":"J0900A","text":"Was the patient or resident screened for pain?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0900B","prefix":"J0900B","text":"The date of the patient's first screening for pain was:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0900C","prefix":"J0900C","text":"The severity of the patient's or resident's pain was:","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0900D","prefix":"J0900D","text":"What type of standardized pain tool was used for the patient?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0905","prefix":"J0905","text":"Is pain an active problem for the patient or resident?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0910A","prefix":"J0910A","text":"Was a comprehensive pain assessment conducted on the patient?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0910B","prefix":"J0910B","text":"When was the patient's comprehensive pain assessment conducted?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0910C","prefix":"J0910C","text":"A comprehensive pain assessment was included for the patient where they needed to check all applicable options.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J2030A","prefix":"J2030A","text":"Was the patient or resident screened for any symptoms of shortness of breath?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J2030B","prefix":"J2030B","text":"The date of the patient's first screening for shortness of breath was:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-10/J2030C","prefix":"J2030C","text":"Did the screening indicate that the patient had shortness of breath?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J2040A","prefix":"J2040A","text":"The form asks if treatment for the patient's shortness of breath was initiated. Please select the most accurate response.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J2040B","prefix":"J2040B","text":"What is the date when the treatment for shortness of breath was initiated for the patient?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-10/J2040C","prefix":"J2040C","text":"What types of treatment for shortness of breath have been initiated for the patient? Please check all that apply.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-14/N0500A","prefix":"N0500A","text":"Was a scheduled opioid initiated or continued for the patient?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-14/N0500B","prefix":"N0500B","text":"The date the patient had their opioid treatment initiated or continued is scheduled for:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-14/N0510A","prefix":"N0510A","text":"Was a PRN opioid medication initiated or continued for the patient?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-14/N0510B","prefix":"N0510B","text":"The date on which the patient's PRN opioid was initiated or continued is:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-14/N0520A","prefix":"N0520A","text":"Was a bowel regimen initiated or continued for the patient? Please select the most accurate response.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-14/N0520B","prefix":"N0520B","text":"The date on which the patient's bowel regimen was initiated or continued is:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400A","prefix":"Z0400A","text":"The patient must provide their signature and title, as well as complete section A, including the date when the section was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400B","prefix":"Z0400B","text":"The patient is required to provide their signature, title, and date they completed section B.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400C","prefix":"Z0400C","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature, title, and date on the completed C section of the form.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400D","prefix":"Z0400D","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature, title, and the date on which they completed Section D of the form.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400E","prefix":"Z0400E","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature, title, and the sections completed, along with the date when section E was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400F","prefix":"Z0400F","text":"The patient must sign, provide their title, complete all sections of the form, and include the date that each section was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400G","prefix":"Z0400G","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature and title, fill out the necessary sections, and date the section when it's completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400H","prefix":"Z0400H","text":"The patient is required to provide their signature, title, and the date they completed Section H on the form.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400I","prefix":"Z0400I","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature, title, and the date they completed section I.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400J","prefix":"Z0400J","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature and title, complete the sections, and include the date when the section was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400K","prefix":"Z0400K","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature and title, and complete the sections indicated on the form. The date the section was completed should also be included.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400L","prefix":"Z0400L","text":"The patient's form must include their signature and title, the sections filled out, as well as the date each section was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0500A","prefix":"Z0500A","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0500B","prefix":"Z0500B","text":"The date on which the RN Assessment Coordinator signed the patient's assessment as complete.","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false}],"_id":"Pp3Y9RxoooWMWG5Ju"}
{"responseType":"QuestionnaireResponse","id":"his-ha-2.00.0","questionnaire":"HIS-HA-2.00.0","title":"Hospice Item Set - Hospice Admission Record","description":"The HIS is a standardized set of items intended to capture patient-level data on each hospice patient admission. HIS items can be used to calculate seven National Quality Forum (NQF) - endorsed measures, and two non-NQF endorsed measures.","status":"draft","authored":"2024-04-27T18:38:55.449Z","item":[{"linkId":"Section-36/A0700","prefix":"A0700","text":"The form asks for the patient's Medicaid number. The patient should enter \"+\" if their Medicaid status is pending, or \"N\" if they are not a Medicaid recipient.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":14},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0800","prefix":"A0800","text":"What is the patient's gender? The possible answers could be male, female, or prefer not to say.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0900","prefix":"A0900","text":"What is the patient's birth date?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0050","prefix":"A0050","text":"The type of record for the patient needs to be specified.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0250","prefix":"A0250","text":"The reason for the patient's assessment needs to be determined.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0220","prefix":"A0220","text":"What is the patient's admission date?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-36/A1802","prefix":"A1802","text":"Where was the patient immediately preceding this admission? Was the patient admitted from another hospital, a nursing home, their residence, or another location?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0550","prefix":"A0550","text":"What is the patient's ZIP code?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":11},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0100A","prefix":"A0100A","text":"Does the patient have a National Provider Identifier (NPI)?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":10},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0100B","prefix":"A0100B","text":"What is the patient's CMS Certification Number (CCN)?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500A","prefix":"A0500A","text":"What is the patient's first name?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500B","prefix":"A0500B","text":"What is the patient's middle initial?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500C","prefix":"A0500C","text":"What is the patient's last name?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":18},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500D","prefix":"A0500D","text":"The form asks for the patient's suffix.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":3},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0600A","prefix":"A0600A","text":"What is the patient's Social Security Number?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":9},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0600B","prefix":"A0600B","text":"What is the patient's Medicare number?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-36/A1000","prefix":"A1000","text":"The patient should check all the applicable boxes for their race or ethnicity.","type":"text","repeats":true,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A1400","prefix":"A1400","text":"The patient needs to fill out the payer information and must check all the options that apply to them.","type":"text","repeats":true,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0205","prefix":"A0205","text":"What was the site of service at the patient's admission?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0245","prefix":"A0245","text":"The date when the initial nursing assessment was initiated for the patient.","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2000A","prefix":"F2000A","text":"Was the patient, resident, or responsible party asked about their preference regarding the use of cardiopulmonary resuscitation (CPR)? Please select the most accurate response.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2000B","prefix":"F2000B","text":"The date on which the patient or responsible party was first asked about their preference regarding the use of CPR.","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2100A","prefix":"F2100A","text":"Was the patient, or their responsible party, asked about their preferences regarding life-sustaining treatments other than CPR? Select the most accurate response.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2100B","prefix":"F2100B","text":"What was the date when the patient or responsible party was first asked about their preferences regarding life-sustaining treatments other than CPR?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2200A","prefix":"F2200A","text":"Was the patient or the responsible party asked about their preference regarding hospitalization? Please select the most accurate response.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2200B","prefix":"F2200B","text":"The date when the patient, resident, or responsible party was first asked about their preference regarding hospitalization is:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-47/F3000A","prefix":"F3000A","text":"Was the patient or their caregiver asked about any spiritual or existential concerns? Please select the most accurate response.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-47/F3000B","prefix":"F3000B","text":"The date on which the patient or caregiver was first asked about spiritual or existential concerns is:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-9/I0010","prefix":"I0010","text":"What is the patient's principal diagnosis?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0900A","prefix":"J0900A","text":"Was the patient or resident screened for pain?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0900B","prefix":"J0900B","text":"The date of the patient's first screening for pain was:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0900C","prefix":"J0900C","text":"The severity of the patient's or resident's pain was:","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0900D","prefix":"J0900D","text":"What type of standardized pain tool was used for the patient?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0905","prefix":"J0905","text":"Is pain an active problem for the patient or resident?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0910A","prefix":"J0910A","text":"Was a comprehensive pain assessment conducted on the patient?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0910B","prefix":"J0910B","text":"When was the patient's comprehensive pain assessment conducted?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0910C","prefix":"J0910C","text":"A comprehensive pain assessment was included for the patient where they needed to check all applicable options.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J2030A","prefix":"J2030A","text":"Was the patient or resident screened for any symptoms of shortness of breath?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J2030B","prefix":"J2030B","text":"The date of the patient's first screening for shortness of breath was:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-10/J2030C","prefix":"J2030C","text":"Did the screening indicate that the patient had shortness of breath?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J2040A","prefix":"J2040A","text":"The form asks if treatment for the patient's shortness of breath was initiated. Please select the most accurate response.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J2040B","prefix":"J2040B","text":"What is the date when the treatment for shortness of breath was initiated for the patient?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-10/J2040C","prefix":"J2040C","text":"What types of treatment for shortness of breath have been initiated for the patient? Please check all that apply.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-14/N0500A","prefix":"N0500A","text":"Was a scheduled opioid initiated or continued for the patient?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-14/N0500B","prefix":"N0500B","text":"The date the patient had their opioid treatment initiated or continued is scheduled for:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-14/N0510A","prefix":"N0510A","text":"Was a PRN opioid medication initiated or continued for the patient?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-14/N0510B","prefix":"N0510B","text":"The date on which the patient's PRN opioid was initiated or continued is:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-14/N0520A","prefix":"N0520A","text":"Was a bowel regimen initiated or continued for the patient? Please select the most accurate response.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-14/N0520B","prefix":"N0520B","text":"The date on which the patient's bowel regimen was initiated or continued is:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400A","prefix":"Z0400A","text":"The patient must provide their signature and title, as well as complete section A, including the date when the section was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400B","prefix":"Z0400B","text":"The patient is required to provide their signature, title, and date they completed section B.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400C","prefix":"Z0400C","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature, title, and date on the completed C section of the form.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400D","prefix":"Z0400D","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature, title, and the date on which they completed Section D of the form.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400E","prefix":"Z0400E","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature, title, and the sections completed, along with the date when section E was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400F","prefix":"Z0400F","text":"The patient must sign, provide their title, complete all sections of the form, and include the date that each section was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400G","prefix":"Z0400G","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature and title, fill out the necessary sections, and date the section when it's completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400H","prefix":"Z0400H","text":"The patient is required to provide their signature, title, and the date they completed Section H on the form.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400I","prefix":"Z0400I","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature, title, and the date they completed section I.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400J","prefix":"Z0400J","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature and title, complete the sections, and include the date when the section was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400K","prefix":"Z0400K","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature and title, and complete the sections indicated on the form. The date the section was completed should also be included.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400L","prefix":"Z0400L","text":"The patient's form must include their signature and title, the sections filled out, as well as the date each section was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0500A","prefix":"Z0500A","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0500B","prefix":"Z0500B","text":"The date on which the RN Assessment Coordinator signed the patient's assessment as complete.","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false}],"_id":"kSSyYcMDjqLzSy9zF"}
{"responseType":"QuestionnaireResponse","id":"his-ha-2.00.0","questionnaire":"HIS-HA-2.00.0","title":"Hospice Item Set - Hospice Admission Record","description":"The HIS is a standardized set of items intended to capture patient-level data on each hospice patient admission. HIS items can be used to calculate seven National Quality Forum (NQF) - endorsed measures, and two non-NQF endorsed measures.","status":"draft","authored":"2024-04-27T18:38:55.449Z","item":[{"linkId":"Section-36/A0700","prefix":"A0700","text":"The form asks for the patient's Medicaid number. The patient should enter \"+\" if their Medicaid status is pending, or \"N\" if they are not a Medicaid recipient.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":14},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0800","prefix":"A0800","text":"What is the patient's gender? The possible answers could be male, female, or prefer not to say.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0900","prefix":"A0900","text":"What is the patient's birth date?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0050","prefix":"A0050","text":"The type of record for the patient needs to be specified.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0250","prefix":"A0250","text":"The reason for the patient's assessment needs to be determined.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0220","prefix":"A0220","text":"What is the patient's admission date?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-36/A1802","prefix":"A1802","text":"Where was the patient immediately preceding this admission? Was the patient admitted from another hospital, a nursing home, their residence, or another location?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0550","prefix":"A0550","text":"What is the patient's ZIP code?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":11},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0100A","prefix":"A0100A","text":"Does the patient have a National Provider Identifier (NPI)?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":10},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0100B","prefix":"A0100B","text":"What is the patient's CMS Certification Number (CCN)?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500A","prefix":"A0500A","text":"What is the patient's first name?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500B","prefix":"A0500B","text":"What is the patient's middle initial?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500C","prefix":"A0500C","text":"What is the patient's last name?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":18},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500D","prefix":"A0500D","text":"The form asks for the patient's suffix.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":3},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0600A","prefix":"A0600A","text":"What is the patient's Social Security Number?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":9},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0600B","prefix":"A0600B","text":"What is the patient's Medicare number?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-36/A1000","prefix":"A1000","text":"The patient should check all the applicable boxes for their race or ethnicity.","type":"text","repeats":true,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A1400","prefix":"A1400","text":"The patient needs to fill out the payer information and must check all the options that apply to them.","type":"text","repeats":true,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0205","prefix":"A0205","text":"What was the site of service at the patient's admission?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0245","prefix":"A0245","text":"The date when the initial nursing assessment was initiated for the patient.","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2000A","prefix":"F2000A","text":"Was the patient, resident, or responsible party asked about their preference regarding the use of cardiopulmonary resuscitation (CPR)? Please select the most accurate response.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2000B","prefix":"F2000B","text":"The date on which the patient or responsible party was first asked about their preference regarding the use of CPR.","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2100A","prefix":"F2100A","text":"Was the patient, or their responsible party, asked about their preferences regarding life-sustaining treatments other than CPR? Select the most accurate response.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2100B","prefix":"F2100B","text":"What was the date when the patient or responsible party was first asked about their preferences regarding life-sustaining treatments other than CPR?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2200A","prefix":"F2200A","text":"Was the patient or the responsible party asked about their preference regarding hospitalization? Please select the most accurate response.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2200B","prefix":"F2200B","text":"The date when the patient, resident, or responsible party was first asked about their preference regarding hospitalization is:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-47/F3000A","prefix":"F3000A","text":"Was the patient or their caregiver asked about any spiritual or existential concerns? Please select the most accurate response.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-47/F3000B","prefix":"F3000B","text":"The date on which the patient or caregiver was first asked about spiritual or existential concerns is:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-9/I0010","prefix":"I0010","text":"What is the patient's principal diagnosis?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0900A","prefix":"J0900A","text":"Was the patient or resident screened for pain?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0900B","prefix":"J0900B","text":"The date of the patient's first screening for pain was:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0900C","prefix":"J0900C","text":"The severity of the patient's or resident's pain was:","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0900D","prefix":"J0900D","text":"What type of standardized pain tool was used for the patient?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0905","prefix":"J0905","text":"Is pain an active problem for the patient or resident?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0910A","prefix":"J0910A","text":"Was a comprehensive pain assessment conducted on the patient?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0910B","prefix":"J0910B","text":"When was the patient's comprehensive pain assessment conducted?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-10/J0910C","prefix":"J0910C","text":"A comprehensive pain assessment was included for the patient where they needed to check all applicable options.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J2030A","prefix":"J2030A","text":"Was the patient or resident screened for any symptoms of shortness of breath?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J2030B","prefix":"J2030B","text":"The date of the patient's first screening for shortness of breath was:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-10/J2030C","prefix":"J2030C","text":"Did the screening indicate that the patient had shortness of breath?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J2040A","prefix":"J2040A","text":"The form asks if treatment for the patient's shortness of breath was initiated. Please select the most accurate response.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-10/J2040B","prefix":"J2040B","text":"What is the date when the treatment for shortness of breath was initiated for the patient?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-10/J2040C","prefix":"J2040C","text":"What types of treatment for shortness of breath have been initiated for the patient? Please check all that apply.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-14/N0500A","prefix":"N0500A","text":"Was a scheduled opioid initiated or continued for the patient?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-14/N0500B","prefix":"N0500B","text":"The date the patient had their opioid treatment initiated or continued is scheduled for:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-14/N0510A","prefix":"N0510A","text":"Was a PRN opioid medication initiated or continued for the patient?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-14/N0510B","prefix":"N0510B","text":"The date on which the patient's PRN opioid was initiated or continued is:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-14/N0520A","prefix":"N0520A","text":"Was a bowel regimen initiated or continued for the patient? Please select the most accurate response.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-14/N0520B","prefix":"N0520B","text":"The date on which the patient's bowel regimen was initiated or continued is:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400A","prefix":"Z0400A","text":"The patient must provide their signature and title, as well as complete section A, including the date when the section was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400B","prefix":"Z0400B","text":"The patient is required to provide their signature, title, and date they completed section B.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400C","prefix":"Z0400C","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature, title, and date on the completed C section of the form.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400D","prefix":"Z0400D","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature, title, and the date on which they completed Section D of the form.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400E","prefix":"Z0400E","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature, title, and the sections completed, along with the date when section E was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400F","prefix":"Z0400F","text":"The patient must sign, provide their title, complete all sections of the form, and include the date that each section was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400G","prefix":"Z0400G","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature and title, fill out the necessary sections, and date the section when it's completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400H","prefix":"Z0400H","text":"The patient is required to provide their signature, title, and the date they completed Section H on the form.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400I","prefix":"Z0400I","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature, title, and the date they completed section I.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400J","prefix":"Z0400J","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature and title, complete the sections, and include the date when the section was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400K","prefix":"Z0400K","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature and title, and complete the sections indicated on the form. The date the section was completed should also be included.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400L","prefix":"Z0400L","text":"The patient's form must include their signature and title, the sections filled out, as well as the date each section was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0500A","prefix":"Z0500A","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0500B","prefix":"Z0500B","text":"The date on which the RN Assessment Coordinator signed the patient's assessment as complete.","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false}],"_id":"NzipoW65BqKtkWM4A"}
{"responseType":"QuestionnaireResponse","id":"his-hd-2.00.0","questionnaire":"HIS-HD-2.00.0","title":"Hospice Item Set - Hospice Discharge Record","description":"The HIS is a standardized set of items intended to capture patient-level data on each hospice patient admission. HIS items can be used to calculate seven National Quality Forum (NQF) - endorsed measures, and two non-NQF endorsed measures.","status":"draft","authored":"2024-04-27T18:40:14.338Z","item":[{"linkId":"Section-36/A0700","prefix":"A0700","text":"The patient is required to enter a \"+\" if their Medicaid Number is pending or \"N\" if they are not a Medicaid recipient.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":14},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0800","prefix":"A0800","text":"The patient's gender is being asked, with the answer choices being male, female, or prefer not to say.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0900","prefix":"A0900","text":"What is the patient's birth date?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0050","prefix":"A0050","text":"The type of record pertaining to the patient needs to be identified.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0250","prefix":"A0250","text":"What is the reason for the patient's assessment?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0220","prefix":"A0220","text":"The admission date of the patient is?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0270","prefix":"A0270","text":"What is the patient's discharge date?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0100A","prefix":"A0100A","text":"What is the patient's National Provider Identifier (NPI)?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":10},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0100B","prefix":"A0100B","text":"What is the patient's CMS Certification Number (CCN)?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500A","prefix":"A0500A","text":"What is the patient's first name?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500B","prefix":"A0500B","text":"What is the patient's middle initial?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500C","prefix":"A0500C","text":"What is the patient's last name?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":18},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500D","prefix":"A0500D","text":"What is the patient's suffix?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":3},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0600A","prefix":"A0600A","text":"What is the patient's Social Security Number?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":9},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0600B","prefix":"A0600B","text":"What is the patient's Medicare number?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-36/A2115","prefix":"A2115","text":"What was the patient's reason for discharge?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5000","prefix":"O5000","text":"Did the patient or resident receive Continuous Home Care, General Inpatient Care, or Respite Care during any of the final three days of their life?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010A1","prefix":"O5010A1","text":"Did a registered nurse visit the patient on the day of their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010A2","prefix":"O5010A2","text":"The registered nurse visited the patient one day prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010A3","prefix":"O5010A3","text":"The patient was visited by a registered nurse two days prior to death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010B1","prefix":"O5010B1","text":"Did the patient receive a visit from a physician, nurse practitioner, or physician assistant on the day of their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010B2","prefix":"O5010B2","text":"Did the patient receive a visit from a physician, nurse practitioner, or physician assistant one day prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010B3","prefix":"O5010B3","text":"Did the patient visit a physician, nurse practitioner, or physician assistant two days prior to their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010C1","prefix":"O5010C1","text":"The medical social worker visited the patient on the day of their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010C2","prefix":"O5010C2","text":"The medical social worker visited the patient one day prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010C3","prefix":"O5010C3","text":"The medical social worker visited the patient two days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010D1","prefix":"O5010D1","text":"Did the patient receive a visit from a chaplain or spiritual counselor on the day of their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010D2","prefix":"O5010D2","text":"Did the patient receive a visit from a chaplain or spiritual counselor one day prior to their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010D3","prefix":"O5010D3","text":"Did the patient receive a visit from a Chaplain or Spiritual Counselor two days prior to their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010E1","prefix":"O5010E1","text":"Did the Licensed Professional Nurse visit the patient on the day of their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010E2","prefix":"O5010E2","text":"Did the licensed professional nurse visit the patient one day prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010E3","prefix":"O5010E3","text":"Did the Licensed Professional Nurse visit the patient two days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010F1","prefix":"O5010F1","text":"Did an aide visit the patient on the day of their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010F2","prefix":"O5010F2","text":"Did the aide visit the patient one day prior to their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010F3","prefix":"O5010F3","text":"Did the aide visit the patient two days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5020","prefix":"O5020","text":"Did the patient receive Continuous Home Care, General Inpatient Care, or Respite Care during any of the final seven days of their life? This question refers to the level of care given in the final seven days.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030A1","prefix":"O5030A1","text":"The patient was visited by a registered nurse three days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030A2","prefix":"O5030A2","text":"The registered nurse visited the patient four days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030A3","prefix":"O5030A3","text":"The registered nurse visited the patient five days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030A4","prefix":"O5030A4","text":"The registered nurse visited the patient six days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030B1","prefix":"O5030B1","text":"Did the patient visit a physician, nurse practitioner, or physician assistant three days prior to their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030B2","prefix":"O5030B2","text":"Did the patient visit a physician, nurse practitioner, or physician assistant four days prior to their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030B3","prefix":"O5030B3","text":"The patient was visited by a physician, nurse practitioner, or physician assistant five days prior to death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030B4","prefix":"O5030B4","text":"Did the patient visit a physician, nurse practitioner, or physician assistant six days prior to their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030C1","prefix":"O5030C1","text":"Did the medical social worker visit the patient three days prior to their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030C2","prefix":"O5030C2","text":"The medical social worker visited the patient four days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030C3","prefix":"O5030C3","text":"The medical social worker visited the patient five days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030C4","prefix":"O5030C4","text":"The medical social worker visited the patient six days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030D1","prefix":"O5030D1","text":"Did the patient have a visit from a chaplain or spiritual counselor three days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030D2","prefix":"O5030D2","text":"The patient's chaplain or spiritual counselor visited four days prior to death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030D3","prefix":"O5030D3","text":"The patient was visited by a Chaplain or Spiritual Counselor five days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030D4","prefix":"O5030D4","text":"Did the patient receive a visit from a chaplain or spiritual counselor six days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030E1","prefix":"O5030E1","text":"The patient was visited by a Licensed Professional Nurse three days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030E2","prefix":"O5030E2","text":"The patient was visited by a Licensed Professional Nurse four days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030E3","prefix":"O5030E3","text":"Did the licensed professional nurse visit the patient five days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030E4","prefix":"O5030E4","text":"The patient was visited by a Licensed Professional Nurse six days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030F1","prefix":"O5030F1","text":"Did the aide visit the patient three days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030F2","prefix":"O5030F2","text":"The patient received visits from the aide four days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030F3","prefix":"O5030F3","text":"Did the aide visit the patient five days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030F4","prefix":"O5030F4","text":"Did the aide visit the patient six days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400A","prefix":"Z0400A","text":"The patient is required to provide their signature and title, and to acknowledge the sections and date that the section was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400B","prefix":"Z0400B","text":"The patient is required to provide their signature, title, and the date on which they completed Section B.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400C","prefix":"Z0400C","text":"The patient is asked to provide their signature and title in the designated sections, and to also indicate the date when the section was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400D","prefix":"Z0400D","text":"The form for the patient asks for the patient's signature, their title, the sections they have completed, and the date they completed section D.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400E","prefix":"Z0400E","text":"The section indicated as \"Signature, Title, Sections, Date Section Completed E\" on the patient's form needs to be filled out.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400F","prefix":"Z0400F","text":"The patient's signature, title, and the date of completion are required in section F.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400G","prefix":"Z0400G","text":"The patient is required to provide their signature and title in the designated sections and indicate the date when they completed Section G.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400H","prefix":"Z0400H","text":"The patient's form includes sections for signature, title, and date of completion, all of which must be filled out by Section H.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400I","prefix":"Z0400I","text":"The patient must provide their signature, title, date, and completed sections in section I.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400J","prefix":"Z0400J","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature and title, and complete sections J of the form. This needs to be done by a specific date.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400K","prefix":"Z0400K","text":"The sections, signature, title, and the date when the section was completed are required information for patient K's form.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400L","prefix":"Z0400L","text":"The sections of the form, including the signature, title, and date section, were completed by the patient.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0500A","prefix":"Z0500A","text":"The form requires the patient's signature.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0500B","prefix":"Z0500B","text":"The date on which the RN Assessment Coordinator signed the patient's assessment as complete.","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false}],"_id":"oHHqHWnFHtxzf8BQL"}
{"responseType":"QuestionnaireResponse","id":"his-hd-2.00.0","questionnaire":"HIS-HD-2.00.0","title":"Hospice Item Set - Hospice Discharge Record","description":"The HIS is a standardized set of items intended to capture patient-level data on each hospice patient admission. HIS items can be used to calculate seven National Quality Forum (NQF) - endorsed measures, and two non-NQF endorsed measures.","status":"draft","authored":"2024-04-27T18:40:14.338Z","item":[{"linkId":"Section-36/A0700","prefix":"A0700","text":"The patient is required to enter a \"+\" if their Medicaid Number is pending or \"N\" if they are not a Medicaid recipient.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":14},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0800","prefix":"A0800","text":"The patient's gender is being asked, with the answer choices being male, female, or prefer not to say.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0900","prefix":"A0900","text":"What is the patient's birth date?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0050","prefix":"A0050","text":"The type of record pertaining to the patient needs to be identified.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0250","prefix":"A0250","text":"What is the reason for the patient's assessment?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0220","prefix":"A0220","text":"The admission date of the patient is?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0270","prefix":"A0270","text":"What is the patient's discharge date?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0100A","prefix":"A0100A","text":"What is the patient's National Provider Identifier (NPI)?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":10},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0100B","prefix":"A0100B","text":"What is the patient's CMS Certification Number 