nly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030D1","prefix":"O5030D1","text":"Did the patient have a visit from a chaplain or spiritual counselor three days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030D2","prefix":"O5030D2","text":"The patient's chaplain or spiritual counselor visited four days prior to death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030D3","prefix":"O5030D3","text":"The patient was visited by a Chaplain or Spiritual Counselor five days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030D4","prefix":"O5030D4","text":"Did the patient receive a visit from a chaplain or spiritual counselor six days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030E1","prefix":"O5030E1","text":"The patient was visited by a Licensed Professional Nurse three days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030E2","prefix":"O5030E2","text":"The patient was visited by a Licensed Professional Nurse four days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030E3","prefix":"O5030E3","text":"Did the licensed professional nurse visit the patient five days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030E4","prefix":"O5030E4","text":"The patient was visited by a Licensed Professional Nurse six days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030F1","prefix":"O5030F1","text":"Did the aide visit the patient three days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030F2","prefix":"O5030F2","text":"The patient received visits from the aide four days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030F3","prefix":"O5030F3","text":"Did the aide visit the patient five days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030F4","prefix":"O5030F4","text":"Did the aide visit the patient six days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400A","prefix":"Z0400A","text":"The patient is required to provide their signature and title, and to acknowledge the sections and date that the section was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400B","prefix":"Z0400B","text":"The patient is required to provide their signature, title, and the date on which they completed Section B.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400C","prefix":"Z0400C","text":"The patient is asked to provide their signature and title in the designated sections, and to also indicate the date when the section was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400D","prefix":"Z0400D","text":"The form for the patient asks for the patient's signature, their title, the sections they have completed, and the date they completed section D.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400E","prefix":"Z0400E","text":"The section indicated as \"Signature, Title, Sections, Date Section Completed E\" on the patient's form needs to be filled out.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400F","prefix":"Z0400F","text":"The patient's signature, title, and the date of completion are required in section F.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400G","prefix":"Z0400G","text":"The patient is required to provide their signature and title in the designated sections and indicate the date when they completed Section G.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400H","prefix":"Z0400H","text":"The patient's form includes sections for signature, title, and date of completion, all of which must be filled out by Section H.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400I","prefix":"Z0400I","text":"The patient must provide their signature, title, date, and completed sections in section I.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400J","prefix":"Z0400J","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature and title, and complete sections J of the form. This needs to be done by a specific date.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400K","prefix":"Z0400K","text":"The sections, signature, title, and the date when the section was completed are required information for patient K's form.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400L","prefix":"Z0400L","text":"The sections of the form, including the signature, title, and date section, were completed by the patient.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0500A","prefix":"Z0500A","text":"The form requires the patient's signature.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0500B","prefix":"Z0500B","text":"The date on which the RN Assessment Coordinator signed the patient's assessment as complete.","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false}],"_id":"bibRpjGCZ9AeivS7A"}
{"responseType":"QuestionnaireResponse","id":"his-hd-2.00.0","questionnaire":"HIS-HD-2.00.0","title":"Hospice Item Set - Hospice Discharge Record","description":"The HIS is a standardized set of items intended to capture patient-level data on each hospice patient admission. HIS items can be used to calculate seven National Quality Forum (NQF) - endorsed measures, and two non-NQF endorsed measures.","status":"draft","authored":"2024-04-27T18:40:14.338Z","item":[{"linkId":"Section-36/A0700","prefix":"A0700","text":"The patient is required to enter a \"+\" if their Medicaid Number is pending or \"N\" if they are not a Medicaid recipient.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":14},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0800","prefix":"A0800","text":"The patient's gender is being asked, with the answer choices being male, female, or prefer not to say.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0900","prefix":"A0900","text":"What is the patient's birth date?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0050","prefix":"A0050","text":"The type of record pertaining to the patient needs to be identified.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0250","prefix":"A0250","text":"What is the reason for the patient's assessment?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0220","prefix":"A0220","text":"The admission date of the patient is?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0270","prefix":"A0270","text":"What is the patient's discharge date?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0100A","prefix":"A0100A","text":"What is the patient's National Provider Identifier (NPI)?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":10},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0100B","prefix":"A0100B","text":"What is the patient's CMS Certification Number (CCN)?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500A","prefix":"A0500A","text":"What is the patient's first name?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500B","prefix":"A0500B","text":"What is the patient's middle initial?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500C","prefix":"A0500C","text":"What is the patient's last name?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":18},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500D","prefix":"A0500D","text":"What is the patient's suffix?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":3},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0600A","prefix":"A0600A","text":"What is the patient's Social Security Number?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":9},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0600B","prefix":"A0600B","text":"What is the patient's Medicare number?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-36/A2115","prefix":"A2115","text":"What was the patient's reason for discharge?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5000","prefix":"O5000","text":"Did the patient or resident receive Continuous Home Care, General Inpatient Care, or Respite Care during any of the final three days of their life?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010A1","prefix":"O5010A1","text":"Did a registered nurse visit the patient on the day of their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010A2","prefix":"O5010A2","text":"The registered nurse visited the patient one day prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010A3","prefix":"O5010A3","text":"The patient was visited by a registered nurse two days prior to death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010B1","prefix":"O5010B1","text":"Did the patient receive a visit from a physician, nurse practitioner, or physician assistant on the day of their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010B2","prefix":"O5010B2","text":"Did the patient receive a visit from a physician, nurse practitioner, or physician assistant one day prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010B3","prefix":"O5010B3","text":"Did the patient visit a physician, nurse practitioner, or physician assistant two days prior to their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010C1","prefix":"O5010C1","text":"The medical social worker visited the patient on the day of their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010C2","prefix":"O5010C2","text":"The medical social worker visited the patient one day prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010C3","prefix":"O5010C3","text":"The medical social worker visited the patient two days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010D1","prefix":"O5010D1","text":"Did the patient receive a visit from a chaplain or spiritual counselor on the day of their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010D2","prefix":"O5010D2","text":"Did the patient receive a visit from a chaplain or spiritual counselor one day prior to their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010D3","prefix":"O5010D3","text":"Did the patient receive a visit from a Chaplain or Spiritual Counselor two days prior to their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010E1","prefix":"O5010E1","text":"Did the Licensed Professional Nurse visit the patient on the day of their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010E2","prefix":"O5010E2","text":"Did the licensed professional nurse visit the patient one day prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010E3","prefix":"O5010E3","text":"Did the Licensed Professional Nurse visit the patient two days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010F1","prefix":"O5010F1","text":"Did an aide visit the patient on the day of their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010F2","prefix":"O5010F2","text":"Did the aide visit the patient one day prior to their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5010F3","prefix":"O5010F3","text":"Did the aide visit the patient two days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5020","prefix":"O5020","text":"Did the patient receive Continuous Home Care, General Inpatient Care, or Respite Care during any of the final seven days of their life? This question refers to the level of care given in the final seven days.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030A1","prefix":"O5030A1","text":"The patient was visited by a registered nurse three days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030A2","prefix":"O5030A2","text":"The registered nurse visited the patient four days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030A3","prefix":"O5030A3","text":"The registered nurse visited the patient five days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030A4","prefix":"O5030A4","text":"The registered nurse visited the patient six days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030B1","prefix":"O5030B1","text":"Did the patient visit a physician, nurse practitioner, or physician assistant three days prior to their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030B2","prefix":"O5030B2","text":"Did the patient visit a physician, nurse practitioner, or physician assistant four days prior to their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030B3","prefix":"O5030B3","text":"The patient was visited by a physician, nurse practitioner, or physician assistant five days prior to death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030B4","prefix":"O5030B4","text":"Did the patient visit a physician, nurse practitioner, or physician assistant six days prior to their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030C1","prefix":"O5030C1","text":"Did the medical social worker visit the patient three days prior to their death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030C2","prefix":"O5030C2","text":"The medical social worker visited the patient four days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030C3","prefix":"O5030C3","text":"The medical social worker visited the patient five days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030C4","prefix":"O5030C4","text":"The medical social worker visited the patient six days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030D1","prefix":"O5030D1","text":"Did the patient have a visit from a chaplain or spiritual counselor three days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030D2","prefix":"O5030D2","text":"The patient's chaplain or spiritual counselor visited four days prior to death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030D3","prefix":"O5030D3","text":"The patient was visited by a Chaplain or Spiritual Counselor five days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030D4","prefix":"O5030D4","text":"Did the patient receive a visit from a chaplain or spiritual counselor six days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030E1","prefix":"O5030E1","text":"The patient was visited by a Licensed Professional Nurse three days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030E2","prefix":"O5030E2","text":"The patient was visited by a Licensed Professional Nurse four days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030E3","prefix":"O5030E3","text":"Did the licensed professional nurse visit the patient five days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030E4","prefix":"O5030E4","text":"The patient was visited by a Licensed Professional Nurse six days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030F1","prefix":"O5030F1","text":"Did the aide visit the patient three days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030F2","prefix":"O5030F2","text":"The patient received visits from the aide four days prior to their death.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030F3","prefix":"O5030F3","text":"Did the aide visit the patient five days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-50/O5030F4","prefix":"O5030F4","text":"Did the aide visit the patient six days prior to death?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400A","prefix":"Z0400A","text":"The patient is required to provide their signature and title, and to acknowledge the sections and date that the section was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400B","prefix":"Z0400B","text":"The patient is required to provide their signature, title, and the date on which they completed Section B.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400C","prefix":"Z0400C","text":"The patient is asked to provide their signature and title in the designated sections, and to also indicate the date when the section was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400D","prefix":"Z0400D","text":"The form for the patient asks for the patient's signature, their title, the sections they have completed, and the date they completed section D.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400E","prefix":"Z0400E","text":"The section indicated as \"Signature, Title, Sections, Date Section Completed E\" on the patient's form needs to be filled out.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400F","prefix":"Z0400F","text":"The patient's signature, title, and the date of completion are required in section F.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400G","prefix":"Z0400G","text":"The patient is required to provide their signature and title in the designated sections and indicate the date when they completed Section G.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400H","prefix":"Z0400H","text":"The patient's form includes sections for signature, title, and date of completion, all of which must be filled out by Section H.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400I","prefix":"Z0400I","text":"The patient must provide their signature, title, date, and completed sections in section I.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400J","prefix":"Z0400J","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature and title, and complete sections J of the form. This needs to be done by a specific date.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400K","prefix":"Z0400K","text":"The sections, signature, title, and the date when the section was completed are required information for patient K's form.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400L","prefix":"Z0400L","text":"The sections of the form, including the signature, title, and date section, were completed by the patient.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0500A","prefix":"Z0500A","text":"The form requires the patient's signature.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0500B","prefix":"Z0500B","text":"The date on which the RN Assessment Coordinator signed the patient's assessment as complete.","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false}],"_id":"hXABMLHkQe5EuaSTp"}
{"responseType":"QuestionnaireResponse","id":"irf-pai-ia-3.0","questionnaire":"IRF-PAI-IA-3.0","title":"Inpatient Rehabilitation Facility Patient Assessment Instrument - IRF Admission","description":"Assessment data collected on all Medicare Part A fee-for-service patients who receive services under Part A from an inpatient rehabilitation facility (IRF) at admission and upon discharge.","status":"draft","authored":"2024-04-27T18:34:15.837Z","item":[{"linkId":"Section-38/A0100B","prefix":"A0100B","text":"Does the patient have a CMS Certification Number (CCN)?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-38/A0500A","prefix":"A0500A","text":"What is the patient's first name?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-38/A0500C","prefix":"A0500C","text":"What is the patient's last name?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":18},{"linkId":"Section-38/A0600A","prefix":"A0600A","text":"What is the patient's Social Security Number?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":9},{"linkId":"Section-38/A0600B","prefix":"A0600B","text":"What is the patient's Medicare number?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-38/A0700","prefix":"A0700","text":"The patient should enter a \"+\" in the Medicaid Number field if the application is pending, or \"N\" if they are not a Medicaid recipient.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":14},{"linkId":"Section-38/A0800","prefix":"A0800","text":"The patient's gender is required. Is the patient male or female?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Male"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"Female"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-38/A0900","prefix":"A0900","text":"What is the patient's birth date?","type":"date","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-38/A1200","prefix":"A1200","text":"What is the patient's marital status? Is he/she single, married, divorced, separated, or widowed?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Never married"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"Married"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"3","display":"Widowed"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"4","display":"Separated"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"5","display":"Divorced"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-38/A0220","prefix":"A0220","text":"What is the admission date for the patient?","type":"date","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-38/11","prefix":"11","text":"What is the zip code of the patient's or resident's pre-hospital residence?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":5},{"linkId":"Section-38/13","prefix":"13","text":"The assessment reference date for the patient has been set.","type":"date","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-38/14","prefix":"14","text":"The admission class of the patient is categorized under which category?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Initial Rehab"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Evaluation"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Readmission"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Unplanned Discharge"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Continuing Rehabilitation"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-38/17","prefix":"17","text":"Does the patient live at home prior to hospitalization? If the pre-hospital living setting is the patient's home, please code accordingly.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Alone"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Family / Relatives"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Friends"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Attendant"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Other"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-38/15A","prefix":"15A","text":"From where was the patient admitted?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Home (private home/apt., board/care, assisted living, group home, transitional living, other residential care arrangements)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Short-term General Hospital"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Skilled Nursing Facility (SNF)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Intermediate Care"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Home under care of organized home health service organization"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"50","display":"Hospice (Home)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"51","display":"Hospice (Institutional Facility)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"61","display":"Swing bed"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"62","display":"Another Inpatient Rehabilitation Facility"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"63","display":"Long-Term Care Hospital (LTCH)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"64","display":"Medicaid Nursing Facility"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"65","display":"Inpatient Psychiatric Facility"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"66","display":"Critical Access Hospital (CAH)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"99","display":"Not Listed"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-38/16A","prefix":"16A","text":"The patient's pre-hospital living setting is required. Please use codes from the 'Admit From' category.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Home (private home/apt., board/care, assisted living, group home, transitional living, other residential care arrangements)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Short-term General Hospital"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Skilled Nursing Facility (SNF)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Intermediate Care"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Home under care of organized home health service organization"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"50","display":"Hospice (Home)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"51","display":"Hospice (Institutional Facility)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"61","display":"Swing bed"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"62","display":"Another Inpatient Rehabilitation Facility"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"63","display":"Long-Term Care Hospital (LTCH)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"64","display":"Medicaid Nursing Facility"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"65","display":"Inpatient Psychiatric Facility"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"66","display":"Critical Access Hospital (CAH)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"99","display":"Not Listed"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-38/1A","prefix":"1A","text":"What is the name of the facility or provider for the patient?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":50},{"linkId":"Section-38/5B","prefix":"5B","text":"What is the patient's or resident's identification number?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":50},{"linkId":"Section-38/A1000","prefix":"A1000","text":"Please check all the boxes that apply to the patient's race and ethnicity.","type":"choice","repeats":true,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"A","display":"American Indian or Alaska Native"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"B","display":"Asian"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10610-6","display":"Black or African American"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA6214-6","display":"Hispanic or Latino"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10611-4","display":"Native Hawaiian or Other Pacific Islander"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4457-3","display":"White"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-41/K0200A","prefix":"K0200A","text":"Please record the most recent height measurement in inches for the patient since their admission.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-41/K0200B","prefix":"K0200B","text":"The patient's weight in pounds should be based on the most recent measure taken within the specified time period. The weight measurement must be executed consistently, adhering to the standard practice of the facility or setting, such as in the morning after voiding, before meals, with shoes off, etc.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":3},{"linkId":"Section-41/21A","prefix":"21A","text":"The impairment group upon admission refers to the condition that required the patient to be admitted to rehabilitation; this should be coded according to Appendix A.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":9},{"linkId":"Section-41/23","prefix":"23","text":"When did the impairment of the patient first begin?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-41/24A1","prefix":"24A1","text":"Does the patient have any arthritis conditions recorded in either the impairment group, etiologic diagnosis, or comorbid conditions that meet all the regulatory requirements for Inpatient Rehabilitation Facility (IRF) classification?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA32-8","display":"No"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA33-6","display":"Yes"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-41/22A","prefix":"22A","text":"The form asks for the patient's etiologic diagnosis A.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/22B","prefix":"22B","text":"The form asks the patient for their etiologic diagnosis B.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/22C","prefix":"22C","text":"The form for the patient includes a section on etiologic diagnosis C.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24A","prefix":"24A","text":"Does the patient have Comorbid Condition A?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24B","prefix":"24B","text":"Does the patient have Comorbid Condition B?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24C","prefix":"24C","text":"Does the patient have Comorbid Condition C?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24D","prefix":"24D","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition D?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24E","prefix":"24E","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition E?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24F","prefix":"24F","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition F?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24G","prefix":"24G","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition G?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24H","prefix":"24H","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition H? Please select 'Yes' or 'No'.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24I","prefix":"24I","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition? Please select either 'Yes' or 'No'.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24J","prefix":"24J","text":"Does the patient have comorbid condition J?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24K","prefix":"24K","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition K?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24L","prefix":"24L","text":"Does the patient have any comorbid conditions? Please list them.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24M","prefix":"24M","text":"The patient has a comorbid condition labelled as M.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24N","prefix":"24N","text":"Does the patient have any comorbid conditions? Please select 'Yes' or 'No'.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24O","prefix":"24O","text":"Does the patient have any comorbid conditions?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24P","prefix":"24P","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition P?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24Q","prefix":"24Q","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24R","prefix":"24R","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition R?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24S","prefix":"24S","text":"The form inquires about the patient's comorbid conditions.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24T","prefix":"24T","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition? Please choose one: Yes or No.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24U","prefix":"24U","text":"The patient has a comorbid condition, referred to as Condition U.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24V","prefix":"24V","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition V?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24W","prefix":"24W","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition W?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24X","prefix":"24X","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition X?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24Y","prefix":"24Y","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition labeled as Y?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-40/20A","prefix":"20A","text":"The primary source of information about the patient is the patient themselves.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27354-2","display":"Medicare Fee For Service"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27355-9","display":"Medicare-Medicare Advantage"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27349-2","display":"Not listed"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-40/20B","prefix":"20B","text":"The form asks the patient to provide a secondary source of information.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27354-2","display":"Medicare Fee For Service"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27355-9","display":"Medicare-Medicare Advantage"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27349-2","display":"Not listed"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-2/BB0700","prefix":"BB0700","text":"The patient's ability to express ideas and wants, considering both verbal and non-verbal expression and excluding language barriers, is being evaluated.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9967-6","display":"Expresses complex messages without difficulty and with speech that is clear and easy to understand"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9966-8","display":"Exhibits some difficulty with expressing needs and ideas (e.g., some words or finishing thoughts) or speech is not clear"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9972-6","display":"Frequently exhibits difficulty with expressing needs and ideas"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11713-7","display":"Rarely/Never expresses self or speech is very difficult to understand"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-2/BB0800","prefix":"BB0800","text":"Does the patient understand verbal and non-verbal content with the use of a hearing aid or device, excluding language barriers?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10110-7","display":"Understands: clear comprehension without cues or repetitions"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10113-1","display":"Usually understands: understands most conversations, but misses some part/intent of message. Requires cues at times to understand"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10083-6","display":"Sometimes understands: understands only basic conversations or simple, direct phrases. Frequently requires cues to understand"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA81-5","display":"Rarely/never understands"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0100","prefix":"C0100","text":"Should a brief interview for mental status be conducted? An attempt should be made to conduct an interview with all patients or residents.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27578-6","display":"No (patient is rarely/never understood)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA33-6","display":"Yes"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0200","prefix":"C0200","text":"The form asks the patient: \"I am going to say three words for you to remember. Please repeat the words after I have said all three. The words are: sock, blue, and bed. Now tell me the three words.\" The form then records the number of words the patient repeated after the first attempt.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA6395-3","display":"Three"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA6404-3","display":"Two"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA6306-0","display":"One"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA137-2","display":"None"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0500","prefix":"C0500","text":"The BIMS Summary Score requires the addition of scores for the Brief Interview for Mental Status questions, with the total score filled in, ranging from 00-15. If the patient or resident was unable to complete the interview, enter 99.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0600","prefix":"C0600","text":"Should the staff conduct an assessment for the patient's mental status?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26843-5","display":"No (patient was able to complete Brief Interview for Mental Status)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26844-3","display":"Yes (patient was unable to complete Brief Interview for Mental Status)"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0300A","prefix":"C0300A","text":"The form asks the patient, \"Please tell me what year it is right now,\" to determine if they are able to accurately report the current year.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9960-1","display":"Correct"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10008-3","display":"Missed by 1 year"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10966-2","display":"Missed by 2-5 years"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10965-4","display":"Missed by > 5 years or no answer"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0300B","prefix":"C0300B","text":"The form asks the patient: \"What month are we in right now?\" The patient is expected to be able to report the correct month.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9927-0","display":"Accurate within 5 days"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10010-9","display":"Missed by 6 days to 1 month"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10969-6","display":"Missed by > 1 month or no answer"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0300C","prefix":"C0300C","text":"The form asks the patient, \"What day of the week is today?\" The patient is then expected to be able to report the correct day of the week.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9960-1","display":"Correct"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9981-7","display":"Incorrect or no answer"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0400A","prefix":"C0400A","text":"The patient is able to recall the word \"sock\".","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10134-7","display":"Yes, no cue required"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10126-3","display":"Yes, after cueing (\"something to wear\")"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10974-6","display":"No - could not recall"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0400B","prefix":"C0400B","text":"The patient is able to recall the color \"blue\".","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10134-7","display":"Yes, no cue required"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10978-7","display":"Yes, after cueing (\"a color\")"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10974-6","display":"No - could not recall"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0400C","prefix":"C0400C","text":"Is the patient able to recall the word \"bed\"?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10134-7","display":"Yes, no cue required"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10125-5","display":"Yes, after cueing (\"a piece of furniture\")"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10974-6","display":"No - could not recall"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0900","prefix":"C0900","text":"The form asked to check all the items that the patient or resident was normally able to recall, indicating their memory or recall ability.","type":"choice","repeats":true,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9962-7","display":"Current season"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9998-1","display":"Location of own room"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10085-1","display":"Staff names and faces"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26728-8","display":"That he or she is in a hospital/hospital unit"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26729-6","display":"None of the above were recalled"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130A1","prefix":"GG0130A1","text":"The question on the form asks about the patient's ability to use suitable utensils to bring food and/or liquid to their mouth and swallow food and/or liquid once the meal is placed before them. This refers to their admission performance.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130B1","prefix":"GG0130B1","text":"The patient's oral hygiene refers to their ability to use suitable items to clean their teeth. If applicable, their ability to handle dentures is evaluated by their capability to insert and remove them into and from the mouth, as well as successfully managing the soaking and rinsing of the dentures with the use of equipment. This is part of their admission performance assessment.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130C1","prefix":"GG0130C1","text":"Does the patient have the ability to maintain perineal hygiene, adjust clothes before and after voiding or having a bowel movement? If the patient is managing an ostomy, does this include wiping the opening but not managing the equipment? Please assess their admission performance.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130A2","prefix":"GG0130A2","text":"The discharge goal for the patient or resident is to gain the ability to use suitable utensils to bring food and/or liquid to their mouth and swallow food and/or liquid once the meal is placed before them.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130B2","prefix":"GG0130B2","text":"The patient's oral hygiene pertains to their ability to use suitable items to clean their teeth. If applicable, their denture care involves the ability to insert and remove dentures into and from the mouth, as well as managing denture soaking and rinsing with the use of equipment. 