,{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170J2","prefix":"GG0170J2","text":"The form asks if, once standing, the patient has the ability to walk at least 50 feet and make two turns. The answer options for this question are \"Yes\" or \"No\". This information will help set a discharge goal for the patient.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170K2","prefix":"GG0170K2","text":"The form inquires if the patient, once standing, has the ability to walk at least 150 feet in a corridor or similar space. The goal is to attain this ability by the time of discharge.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170R2","prefix":"GG0170R2","text":"The discharge goal for the patient is to be able once seated in the wheelchair or scooter, to wheel at least 50 feet and make two turns.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170S2","prefix":"GG0170S2","text":"The discharge goal for the patient is to have the ability to wheel at least 150 feet in a corridor or similar space once they are seated in a wheelchair or scooter.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170Q1","prefix":"GG0170Q1","text":"Does the patient or resident use a wheelchair and/or scooter upon admission?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA32-8","display":"No"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA33-6","display":"Yes"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170RR1","prefix":"GG0170RR1","text":"Please indicate the type of wheelchair or scooter that the patient uses upon admission.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA19016-7","display":"Manual"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26847-6","display":"Motorized"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170SS1","prefix":"GG0170SS1","text":"The patient is required to indicate the type of wheelchair or scooter used upon admission.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA19016-7","display":"Manual"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26847-6","display":"Motorized"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130E1","prefix":"GG0130E1","text":"The form inquires about the patient's ability to bathe themselves, which includes washing, rinsing, and drying themselves, excluding washing of the back and hair. It does not consider the ability to transfer in or out of the tub or shower. This information is required for the Admission Performance assessment.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130F1","prefix":"GG0130F1","text":"The admission performance form inquires about the patient's ability to dress and undress above the waist, including the handling of fasteners if applicable, under the section labeled 'Upper Body Dressing'.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130G1","prefix":"GG0130G1","text":"On the admission form, it asks about the patient's ability to dress and undress below the waist, including handling fasteners. It does not include dealing with footwear.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130H1","prefix":"GG0130H1","text":"The form asks about the patient's ability to put on and take off socks and shoes or other footwear that is appropriate for safe mobility, including fasteners if applicable. This is in reference to their admission performance.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170G1","prefix":"GG0170G1","text":"The form asks about the patient's ability to transfer in and out of a car or van from the passenger side upon admission. This does not include the patient's ability to open or close the door or fasten their seat belt.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170L1","prefix":"GG0170L1","text":"The form asks about the patient's ability to walk 10 feet on uneven or sloping surfaces (indoor or outdoor), such as turf or gravel, in terms of their admission performance.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170M1","prefix":"GG0170M1","text":"The form asks about the patient's ability to go up and down a curb and/or up and down one step, as a measure of their admission performance.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170N1","prefix":"GG0170N1","text":"The patient's admission performance indicates their ability to go up and down four steps, either with or without the aid of a rail.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170O1","prefix":"GG0170O1","text":"The question on the form asks about the patient's ability to go up and down 12 steps with or without a rail. The label is \"Admission Performance\".","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170P1","prefix":"GG0170P1","text":"The form asks about the patient's ability to bend or stoop from a standing position to pick up a small object, such as a spoon, from the floor. This question is referred to as the 'Admission Performance'.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130E2","prefix":"GG0130E2","text":"The form asks about the patient's ability to shower or bathe themselves, which includes washing, rinsing, and drying, but excludes washing of the back and hair. It is important to note, this does not include the patient's ability to transfer in and out of the tub or shower. The focus of this question is to understand the patient's discharge goal.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130F2","prefix":"GG0130F2","text":"The patient's discharge goal includes developing the ability to dress and undress themselves above the waist, including managing fasteners, if applicable.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130G2","prefix":"GG0130G2","text":"The discharge goal for the patient is to develop the ability to dress and undress below the waist, including handling fasteners, but this does not include managing footwear.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130H2","prefix":"GG0130H2","text":"The discharge goal for the patient is to develop the ability to put on and take off socks and shoes or other footwear that is appropriate for safe mobility, including managing fasteners, if applicable.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170G2","prefix":"GG0170G2","text":"The patient's discharge goal is to be able to transfer in and out of a car or van on the passenger side. This does not include the ability to open or close the door or fasten the seat belt.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170L2","prefix":"GG0170L2","text":"The patient's discharge goal is to have the ability to walk 10 feet on uneven or sloping surfaces, such as turf or gravel, indoors or outdoors.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170M2","prefix":"GG0170M2","text":"The discharge goal for the patient is the ability to go up and down a curb and/or up and down one step.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170N2","prefix":"GG0170N2","text":"The discharge goal for the patient is to develop the ability to go up and down four steps, with or without the assistance of a rail.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170O2","prefix":"GG0170O2","text":"The discharge goal for the patient is to have the ability to go up and down 12 steps with or without a rail.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170P2","prefix":"GG0170P2","text":"The discharge goal for the patient is to develop the ability to bend or stoop from a standing position to pick up a small object, such as a spoon, from the floor.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0100A","prefix":"GG0100A","text":"Please code the patient's or resident's need for assistance with activities such as bathing, dressing, using the toilet, and eating prior to their current illness, exacerbation, or injury.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11539-6","display":"Independent - Patient completed the activities by him/herself, with or without an assistive device, with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26832-8","display":"Needed some help - Patient needed partial assistance from another person to complete activities."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11541-2","display":"Dependent - A helper completed the activities for the patient."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4489-6","display":"Unknown"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4720-4","display":"Not applicable"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0100B","prefix":"GG0100B","text":"The form asks for the patient's or resident's level of need for assistance with indoor mobility, specifically walking from room to room, prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury. This includes whether they required a device such as a cane, crutch, or walker.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11539-6","display":"Independent - Patient completed the activities by him/herself, with or without an assistive device, with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26832-8","display":"Needed some help - Patient needed partial assistance from another person to complete activities."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11541-2","display":"Dependent - A helper completed the activities for the patient."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4489-6","display":"Unknown"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4720-4","display":"Not applicable"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0100C","prefix":"GG0100C","text":"Please code the patient's or resident's need for assistance with internal or external stairs, whether with or without a device such as a cane, crutch, or walker, prior to their current illness, exacerbation, or injury.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11539-6","display":"Independent - Patient completed the activities by him/herself, with or without an assistive device, with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26832-8","display":"Needed some help - Patient needed partial assistance from another person to complete activities."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11541-2","display":"Dependent - A helper completed the activities for the patient."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4489-6","display":"Unknown"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4720-4","display":"Not applicable"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0100D","prefix":"GG0100D","text":"Please code the patient's need for assistance with planning regular tasks, such as shopping or remembering to take medication, prior to their current illness, exacerbation, or injury.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11539-6","display":"Independent - Patient completed the activities by him/herself, with or without an assistive device, with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26832-8","display":"Needed some help - Patient needed partial assistance from another person to complete activities."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11541-2","display":"Dependent - A helper completed the activities for the patient."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4489-6","display":"Unknown"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4720-4","display":"Not applicable"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0110","prefix":"GG0110","text":"The form asks for information about the devices and aids that the patient or resident was using prior to their current illness, exacerbation, or injury. It requests that all applicable options be checked.","type":"choice","repeats":true,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA18363-4","display":"Manual wheelchair"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26730-4","display":"Motorized wheelchair and/or scooter"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11549-5","display":"Mechanical lift"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10117-2","display":"Walker"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10046-3","display":"Orthotics/Prosthetics"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9-3","display":"None of the above"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-8/H0400","prefix":"H0400","text":"Please select the category that best describes the bowel continence of the patient or resident.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11042-1","display":"Always continent"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11048-8","display":"Occasionally incontinent (one episode of bowel incontinence)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11049-6","display":"Frequently incontinent (2 or more episodes of bowel incontinence, but at least one continent bowel movement)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11050-4","display":"Always incontinent (no episodes of continent bowel movements)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26835-1","display":"Not rated, patient had an ostomy or did not have a bowel movement for the entire 3 days"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-8/H0350","prefix":"H0350","text":"Please select the one category that best describes the patient's bladder continence.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26833-6","display":"Always continent (no documented incontinence)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26736-1","display":"Stress incontinence only"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26834-4","display":"Incontinent less than daily (e.g., once or twice during the 3-day assessment period)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9979-1","display":"Incontinent daily (at least once a day)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9934-6","display":"Always incontinent"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26738-7","display":"No urine output (e.g., renal failure)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11693-1","display":"Not applicable (e.g., indwelling catheter)"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-9/I0000","prefix":"I0000","text":"The form asks the patient to check all active diagnoses they have had in the last 7 days. It should be noted that the diagnoses listed in parentheses are provided as examples and should not be considered as all-inclusive lists.","type":"choice","repeats":true,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA18399-8","display":"Peripheral vascular disease (PVD) or peripheral arterial disease (PAD)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26741-1","display":"Diabetes mellitus (DM) (e.g., diabetic retinopathy, nephropathy, and neuropathy)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9-3","display":"None of the above"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-10/J1750","prefix":"J1750","text":"Does the patient or resident have a history of falls, specifically, have they experienced two or more falls in the past year or any fall that resulted in injury in the past year?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA32-8","display":"No"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA33-6","display":"Yes"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4489-6","display":"Unknown"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-10/J2000","prefix":"J2000","text":"Did the patient have any major surgery during the 100 days prior to admission?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA32-8","display":"No"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA33-6","display":"Yes"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4489-6","display":"Unknown"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-11/K0110","prefix":"K0110","text":"Indicate the patient's usual ability to swallow by checking all applicable boxes pertaining to their swallowing and nutritional status.","type":"choice","repeats":true,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10070-3","display":"Regular food: solids and liquids swallowed safely without supervision and without modified food or liquid consistency."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10013-3","display":"Modified food consistency/supervision: Patient requires modified food or liquid consistency and/or needs supervision during eating for safety."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10103-2","display":"Tube/parenteral feeding: Tube/parenteral feeding used wholly or partially as a means of sustenance."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-13/M0210","prefix":"M0210","text":"Does the patient or resident have one or more unhealed pressure ulcers or injuries?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA32-8","display":"No"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA33-6","display":"Yes"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-13/M0300B1","prefix":"M0300B1","text":"The form is asking the patient to report the number of Stage 2 pressure ulcers they currently have.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-13/M0300C1","prefix":"M0300C1","text":"The patient has been asked to indicate the number of Stage 3 pressure ulcers they have.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-13/M0300D1","prefix":"M0300D1","text":"The patient has a certain number of stage 4 pressure ulcers.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-13/M0300E1","prefix":"M0300E1","text":"How many unstageable pressure ulcers or injuries does the patient have due to a non-removable dressing or device?","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-13/M0300F1","prefix":"M0300F1","text":"The form is asking the patient about the number of unstageable pressure ulcers they have due to the coverage of the wound bed by slough and/or eschar.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-13/M0300G1","prefix":"M0300G1","text":"The patient has a number of unstageable pressure injuries presenting as deep tissue injury.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-13/M0300A1","prefix":"M0300A1","text":"The form is asking the patient to disclose the number of Stage 1 pressure injuries they have.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1},{"linkId":"Section-14/N2001","prefix":"N2001","text":"Did a complete drug regimen review conducted for the patient identify any potential clinically significant medication issues?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27634-7","display":"No - No issues found during review"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27635-4","display":"Yes - Issues found during review"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27636-2","display":"NA - Patient is not taking any medications"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-14/N2003","prefix":"N2003","text":"Did the facility or setting contact a physician or a designated representative by midnight of the next calendar day and complete the prescribed or recommended actions in response to the identified potential clinically significant medication issues for the patient?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA32-8","display":"No"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA33-6","display":"Yes"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-15/O0100","prefix":"O0100","text":"The patient should check all of the following special treatments, procedures, and programs that were performed on them.","type":"choice","repeats":true,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"N","display":"Total Parenteral Nutrition"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10101-6","display":"Total parenteral nutrition"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-19/Z0400A","prefix":"Z0400A","text":"The form for the patient includes sections such as the signature, title, and date section A that need to be completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-19/Z0400B","prefix":"Z0400B","text":"The patient must provide their signature, title, and date in the sections where the section completion is indicated by a 'B'.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-19/Z0400C","prefix":"Z0400C","text":"The sections labeled \"Signature\", \"Title\", \"Sections\", and \"Date Section Completed C\" must be filled out by the patient.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-19/Z0400D","prefix":"Z0400D","text":"The sections of the form completed by the patient are signed and dated, with their title also mentioned.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-19/Z0400E","prefix":"Z0400E","text":"The patient should fill out the signature, title, and sections, then indicate the date the section E was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-19/Z0400F","prefix":"Z0400F","text":"The patient's signature, title, and the date the form sections were completed are required in section F.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-19/Z0400G","prefix":"Z0400G","text":"The patient needs to provide their Signature, Title, and complete the Sections mentioned in the form, including the Date Section Completed G.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-19/Z0400H","prefix":"Z0400H","text":"The patient needs to include their signature, title, and date on the completed sections H of the form.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-19/Z0400I","prefix":"Z0400I","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature and title, complete the sections, and indicate the date on which the section was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-19/Z0400J","prefix":"Z0400J","text":"The patient is required to provide their signature, title, and the date on which the sections were completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-19/Z0400K","prefix":"Z0400K","text":"The patient needs to provide their signature, their title, and fill out the sections on the form, indicating the date each section was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-19/Z0400L","prefix":"Z0400L","text":"The patient's form includes a signature, title, sections, and a section indicating the date the form was completed.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100}],"_id":"oshhfdN5vpyHbxi8b"}
{"responseType":"QuestionnaireResponse","id":"irf-pai-ia-3.0","questionnaire":"IRF-PAI-IA-3.0","title":"Inpatient Rehabilitation Facility Patient Assessment Instrument - IRF Admission","description":"Assessment data collected on all Medicare Part A fee-for-service patients who receive services under Part A from an inpatient rehabilitation facility (IRF) at admission and upon discharge.","status":"draft","authored":"2024-04-27T18:34:15.837Z","item":[{"linkId":"Section-38/A0100B","prefix":"A0100B","text":"Does the patient have a CMS Certification Number (CCN)?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-38/A0500A","prefix":"A0500A","text":"What is the patient's first name?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-38/A0500C","prefix":"A0500C","text":"What is the patient's last name?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":18},{"linkId":"Section-38/A0600A","prefix":"A0600A","text":"What is the patient's Social Security Number?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":9},{"linkId":"Section-38/A0600B","prefix":"A0600B","text":"What is the patient's Medicare number?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12},{"linkId":"Section-38/A0700","prefix":"A0700","text":"The patient should enter a \"+\" in the Medicaid Number field if the application is pending, or \"N\" if they are not a Medicaid recipient.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":14},{"linkId":"Section-38/A0800","prefix":"A0800","text":"The patient's gender is required. Is the patient male or female?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Male"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"Female"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-38/A0900","prefix":"A0900","text":"What is the patient's birth date?","type":"date","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-38/A1200","prefix":"A1200","text":"What is the patient's marital status? Is he/she single, married, divorced, separated, or widowed?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Never married"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"Married"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"3","display":"Widowed"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"4","display":"Separated"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"5","display":"Divorced"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-38/A0220","prefix":"A0220","text":"What is the admission date for the patient?","type":"date","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-38/11","prefix":"11","text":"What is the zip code of the patient's or resident's pre-hospital residence?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":5},{"linkId":"Section-38/13","prefix":"13","text":"The assessment reference date for the patient has been set.","type":"date","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-38/14","prefix":"14","text":"The admission class of the patient is categorized under which category?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Initial Rehab"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Evaluation"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Readmission"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Unplanned Discharge"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Continuing Rehabilitation"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-38/17","prefix":"17","text":"Does the patient live at home prior to hospitalization? If the pre-hospital living setting is the patient's home, please code accordingly.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Alone"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Family / Relatives"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Friends"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Attendant"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Other"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-38/15A","prefix":"15A","text":"From where was the patient admitted?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Home (private home/apt., board/care, assisted living, group home, transitional living, other residential care arrangements)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Short-term General Hospital"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Skilled Nursing Facility (SNF)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Intermediate Care"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Home under care of organized home health service organization"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"50","display":"Hospice (Home)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"51","display":"Hospice (Institutional Facility)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"61","display":"Swing bed"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"62","display":"Another Inpatient Rehabilitation Facility"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"63","display":"Long-Term Care Hospital (LTCH)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"64","display":"Medicaid Nursing Facility"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"65","display":"Inpatient Psychiatric Facility"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"66","display":"Critical Access Hospital (CAH)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"99","display":"Not Listed"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-38/16A","prefix":"16A","text":"The patient's pre-hospital living setting is required. Please use codes from the 'Admit From' category.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Home (private home/apt., board/care, assisted living, group home, transitional living, other residential care arrangements)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Short-term General Hospital"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Skilled Nursing Facility (SNF)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Intermediate Care"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Home under care of organized home health service organization"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"50","display":"Hospice (Home)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"51","display":"Hospice (Institutional Facility)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"61","display":"Swing bed"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"62","display":"Another Inpatient Rehabilitation Facility"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"63","display":"Long-Term Care Hospital (LTCH)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"64","display":"Medicaid Nursing Facility"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"65","display":"Inpatient Psychiatric Facility"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"66","display":"Critical Access Hospital (CAH)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"99","display":"Not Listed"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-38/1A","prefix":"1A","text":"What is the name of the facility or provider for the patient?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":50},{"linkId":"Section-38/5B","prefix":"5B","text":"What is the patient's or resident's identification number?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":50},{"linkId":"Section-38/A1000","prefix":"A1000","text":"Please check all the boxes that apply to the patient's race and ethnicity.","type":"choice","repeats":true,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"A","display":"American Indian or Alaska Native"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"B","display":"Asian"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10610-6","display":"Black or African American"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA6214-6","display":"Hispanic or Latino"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10611-4","display":"Native Hawaiian or Other Pacific Islander"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4457-3","display":"White"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-41/K0200A","prefix":"K0200A","text":"Please record the most recent height measurement in inches for the patient since their admission.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-41/K0200B","prefix":"K0200B","text":"The patient's weight in pounds should be based on the most recent measure taken within the specified time period. The weight measurement must be executed consistently, adhering to the standard practice of the facility or setting, such as in the morning after voiding, before meals, with shoes off, etc.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":3},{"linkId":"Section-41/21A","prefix":"21A","text":"The impairment group upon admission refers to the condition that required the patient to be admitted to rehabilitation; this should be coded according to Appendix A.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":9},{"linkId":"Section-41/23","prefix":"23","text":"When did the impairment of the patient first begin?","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false},{"linkId":"Section-41/24A1","prefix":"24A1","text":"Does the patient have any arthritis conditions recorded in either the impairment group, etiologic diagnosis, or comorbid conditions that meet all the regulatory requirements for Inpatient Rehabilitation Facility (IRF) classification?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA32-8","display":"No"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA33-6","display":"Yes"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-41/22A","prefix":"22A","text":"The form asks for the patient's etiologic diagnosis A.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/22B","prefix":"22B","text":"The form asks the patient for their etiologic diagnosis B.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/22C","prefix":"22C","text":"The form for the patient includes a section on etiologic diagnosis C.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24A","prefix":"24A","text":"Does the patient have Comorbid Condition A?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24B","prefix":"24B","text":"Does the patient have Comorbid Condition B?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24C","prefix":"24C","text":"Does the patient have Comorbid Condition C?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24D","prefix":"24D","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition D?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24E","prefix":"24E","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition E?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24F","prefix":"24F","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition F?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24G","prefix":"24G","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition G?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24H","prefix":"24H","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition H? Please select 'Yes' or 'No'.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24I","prefix":"24I","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition? Please select either 'Yes' or 'No'.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24J","prefix":"24J","text":"Does the patient have comorbid condition J?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24K","prefix":"24K","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition K?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24L","prefix":"24L","text":"Does the patient have any comorbid conditions? Please list them.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24M","prefix":"24M","text":"The patient has a comorbid condition labelled as M.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24N","prefix":"24N","text":"Does the patient have any comorbid conditions? Please select 'Yes' or 'No'.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24O","prefix":"24O","text":"Does the patient have any comorbid conditions?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24P","prefix":"24P","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition P?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24Q","prefix":"24Q","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24R","prefix":"24R","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition R?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24S","prefix":"24S","text":"The form inquires about the patient's comorbid conditions.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24T","prefix":"24T","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition? Please choose one: Yes or No.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24U","prefix":"24U","text":"The patient has a comorbid condition, referred to as Condition U.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24V","prefix":"24V","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition V?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24W","prefix":"24W","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition W?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24X","prefix":"24X","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition X?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-41/24Y","prefix":"24Y","text":"Does the patient have a comorbid condition labeled as Y?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8},{"linkId":"Section-40/20A","prefix":"20A","text":"The primary source of information about the patient is the patient themselves.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27354-2","display":"Medicare Fee For Service"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27355-9","display":"Medicare-Medicare Advantage"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27349-2","display":"Not listed"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-40/20B","prefix":"20B","text":"The form asks the patient to provide a secondary source of information.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27354-2","display":"Medicare Fee For Service"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27355-9","display":"Medicare-Medicare Advantage"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27349-2","display":"Not listed"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-2/BB0700","prefix":"BB0700","text":"The patient's ability to express ideas and wants, considering both verbal and non-verbal expression and excluding language barriers, is being evaluated.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9967-6","display":"Expresses complex messages without difficulty and with speech that is clear and easy to understand"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9966-8","display":"Exhibits some difficulty with expressing needs and ideas (e.g., some words or finishing thoughts) or speech is not clear"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9972-6","display":"Frequently exhibits difficulty with expressing needs and ideas"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11713-7","display":"Rarely/Never expresses self or speech is very difficult to understand"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-2/BB0800","prefix":"BB0800","text":"Does the patient understand verbal and non-verbal content with the use of a hearing aid or device, excluding language barriers?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10110-7","display":"Understands: clear comprehension without cues or repetitions"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10113-1","display":"Usually understands: understands most conversations, but misses some part/intent of message. Requires cues at times to understand"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10083-6","display":"Sometimes understands: understands only basic conversations or simple, direct phrases. Frequently requires cues to understand"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA81-5","display":"Rarely/never understands"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0100","prefix":"C0100","text":"Should a brief interview for mental status be conducted? An attempt should be made to conduct an interview with all patients or residents.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27578-6","display":"No (patient is rarely/never understood)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA33-6","display":"Yes"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0200","prefix":"C0200","text":"The form asks the patient: \"I am going to say three words for you to remember. Please repeat the words after I have said all three. The words are: sock, blue, and bed. Now tell me the three words.\" The form then records the number of words the patient repeated after the first attempt.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA6395-3","display":"Three"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA6404-3","display":"Two"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA6306-0","display":"One"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA137-2","display":"None"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0500","prefix":"C0500","text":"The BIMS Summary Score requires the addition of scores for the Brief Interview for Mental Status questions, with the total score filled in, ranging from 00-15. If the patient or resident was unable to complete the interview, enter 99.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0600","prefix":"C0600","text":"Should the staff conduct an assessment for the patient's mental status?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26843-5","display":"No (patient was able to complete Brief Interview for Mental Status)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26844-3","display":"Yes (patient was unable to complete Brief Interview for Mental Status)"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0300A","prefix":"C0300A","text":"The form asks the patient, \"Please tell me what year it is right now,\" to determine if they are able to accurately report the current year.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9960-1","display":"Correct"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10008-3","display":"Missed by 1 year"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10966-2","display":"Missed by 2-5 years"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10965-4","display":"Missed by > 5 years or no answer"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0300B","prefix":"C0300B","text":"The form asks the patient: \"What month are we in right now?\" The patient is expected to be able to report the correct month.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9927-0","display":"Accurate within 5 days"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10010-9","display":"Missed by 6 days to 1 month"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10969-6","display":"Missed by > 1 month or no answer"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0300C","prefix":"C0300C","text":"The form asks the patient, \"What day of the week is today?\" The patient is then expected to be able to report the correct day of the week.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9960-1","display":"Correct"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9981-7","display":"Incorrect or no answer"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0400A","prefix":"C0400A","text":"The patient is able to recall the word \"sock\".","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10134-7","display":"Yes, no cue required"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10126-3","display":"Yes, after cueing (\"something to wear\")"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10974-6","display":"No - could not recall"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0400B","prefix":"C0400B","text":"The patient is able to recall the color \"blue\".","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10134-7","display":"Yes, no cue required"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10978-7","display":"Yes, after cueing (\"a color\")"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10974-6","display":"No - could not recall"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0400C","prefix":"C0400C","text":"Is the patient able to recall the word \"bed\"?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10134-7","display":"Yes, no cue required"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10125-5","display":"Yes, after cueing (\"a piece of furniture\")"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10974-6","display":"No - could not recall"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0900","prefix":"C0900","text":"The form asked to check all the items that the patient or resident was normally able to recall, indicating their memory or recall ability.","type":"choice","repeats":true,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9962-7","display":"Current season"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9998-1","display":"Location of own room"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10085-1","display":"Staff names and faces"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26728-8","display":"That he or she is in a hospital/hospital unit"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26729-6","display":"None of the above were recalled"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130A1","prefix":"GG0130A1","text":"The question on the form asks about the patient's ability to use suitable utensils to bring food and/or liquid to their mouth and swallow food and/or liquid once the meal is placed before them. This refers to their admission performance.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130B1","prefix":"GG0130B1","text":"The patient's oral hygiene refers to their ability to use suitable items to clean their teeth. If applicable, their ability to handle dentures is evaluated by their capability to insert and remove them into and from the mouth, as well as successfully managing the soaking and rinsing of the dentures with the use of equipment. This is part of their admission performance assessment.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130C1","prefix":"GG0130C1","text":"Does the patient have the ability to maintain perineal hygiene, adjust clothes before and after voiding or having a bowel movement? If the patient is managing an ostomy, does this include wiping the opening but not managing the equipment? Please assess their admission performance.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130A2","prefix":"GG0130A2","text":"The discharge goal for the patient or resident is to gain the ability to use suitable utensils to bring food and/or liquid to their mouth and swallow food and/or liquid once the meal is placed before them.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130B2","prefix":"GG0130B2","text":"The patient's oral hygiene pertains to their ability to use suitable items to clean their teeth. If applicable, their denture care involves the ability to insert and remove dentures into and from the mouth, as well as managing denture soaking and rinsing with the use of equipment. The discharge goal is to ensure these abilities.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather cons