prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"10","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g. lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"88","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-11/K0200B","prefix":"K0200B","text":"The patient's weight in pounds should be based on the most recent measure taken in the last specified number of days. The weight must be measured consistently, in accordance with the standard practice of the facility or setting, which may include measurements in the morning after voiding, before meals, with shoes off, etc.","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":3},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170A1","prefix":"GG0170A1","text":"The form inquires about the patient's admission performance concerning their ability to roll from lying on their back to their left and right side, and then return to lying on their back on the bed.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/res