s to be marked as 'A'.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170SS1","prefix":"GG0170SS1","text":"The form asks the patient to indicate the type of wheelchair or scooter they use upon admission.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Manual"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA19016-7","display":"Manual"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"Motorized"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26847-6","display":"Motorized"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130D1","prefix":"GG0130D1","text":"The admission performance form inquires about the patient's ability to wash, rinse, and dry the face, hands, chest, and arms while sitting in a chair or bed.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the 