the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"09","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the {patient/resident} did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"10","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g. lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"88","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C1610C","prefix":"C1610C","text":"Did the patient have difficulty focusing attention, for example, being easily distractible or having difficulty keeping track of what was being said? The possible answers could be 'Yes', 'No', or 'Sometimes'.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"0","display":"No"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA32-8","display":"No"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Yes"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA33-6","display":"Yes"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-15/O0150D","prefix":"O0150D","text":"Is there documentation of the reason or reasons in the patient's or resident's medical record that indicates why the patient or resident was deemed medically unready for SBT by the second day of their stay at the Long-Term Care Hospital?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"0","display":"No"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA32-8","display":"No"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Yes"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA33-6","display":"Yes"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130D2","prefix":"GG0130D2","text":"The discharge goal for the patient is to have the ability to wash, rinse, and dry their face, hands, chest, and arms while sitting in a chair or bed.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assis