{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400C","prefix":"Z0400C","text":"Signature, Title, Sections, Date Section Completed C","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100,"id":"item.6.item.0.item.2","description":"The patient needs to provide their signature, title, and complete the sections required on the form. They should also include the date the section was completed, indicated as section C."},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400D","prefix":"Z0400D","text":"Signature, Title, Sections, Date Section Completed D","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100,"id":"item.6.item.0.item.3","description":"The patient filled out the signature, title, and sections, and completed section D on a specific date."},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400E","prefix":"Z0400E","text":"Signature, Title, Sections, Date Section Completed E","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100,"id":"item.6.item.0.item.4","description":"The sections of the form labeled \"Signature\", \"Title\", and \"Date Section Completed E\" should be filled out by the patient."},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400F","prefix":"Z0400F","text":"Signature, Title, Sections, Date Section Completed F","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100,"id":"item.6.item.0.item.5","description":"The form for the patient includes sections for signature, title, and the date when the section was completed."},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400G","prefix":"Z0400G","text":"Signature, Title, Sections, Date Section Completed G","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100,"id":"item.6.item.0.item.6","description":"The patient's signature, title, and the date the section was completed are all required in Section G."},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400H","prefix":"Z0400H","text":"Signature, Title, Sections, Date Section Completed H","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100,"id":"item.6.item.0.item.7","description":"The patient is required to provide their signature and title in the designated sections, and also specify the date when the section was completed."},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400I","prefix":"Z0400I","text":"Signature, Title, Sections, Date Section Completed I","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100,"id":"item.6.item.0.item.8","description":"The patient needs to provide their signature, title, and the sections they have completed on the form, along with the date the section was finished."},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400J","prefix":"Z0400J","text":"Signature, Title, Sections, Date Section Completed J","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100,"id":"item.6.item.0.item.9","description":"The patient is required to provide their signature, title, and date for each completed section on the form."},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400K","prefix":"Z0400K","text":"Signature, Title, Sections, Date Section Completed K","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100,"id":"item.6.item.0.item.10","description":"The patient is required to provide their signature, title, and date on the sections they have completed in Section K."},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400L","prefix":"Z0400L","text":"Signature, Title, Sections, Date Section Completed L","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100,"id":"item.6.item.0.item.11","description":"The patient must provide their signature, title, and date in the sections indicated upon completion."},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0500","prefix":"Z0500","text":"Signature of RN Coordinator Verifying Assessment Completion","type":"group","repeats":false,"readOnly":true,"item":[{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0500A","prefix":"Z0500A","text":"Signature","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100,"id":"item.6.item.1.item.0"},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0500B","prefix":"Z0500B","text":"Date RN Assessment Coordinator signed assessment as complete","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"id":"item.6.item.1.item.1"}],"id":"item.6.item.1","description":"The signature of the RN Coordinator is required to verify the completion of the patient's assessment."},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0500A","prefix":"Z0500A","text":"Signature","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100,"id":"item.6.item.1.item.0","description":"The form requires the patient's signature."},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0500B","prefix":"Z0500B","text":"Date RN Assessment Coordinator signed assessment as complete","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"id":"item.6.item.1.item.1","description":"The date on which the Registered Nurse Assessment Coordinator signed the patient's assessment as complete."},null],"_id":"C7j9HG5DL8RLhgqgH"}
{"responseType":"QuestionnaireResponse","questionnaire":"HIS-HA-2.00.0","id":"HIS-HA-2.00.0-1","title":"Hospice Item Set - Hospice Admission Record","description":"The HIS is a standardized set of items intended to capture patient-level data on each hospice patient admission. HIS items can be used to calculate seven National Quality Forum (NQF) - endorsed measures, and two non-NQF endorsed measures.","status":"draft","authored":"2024-09-20T06:29:57.933Z","item":[{"linkId":"Section-36","text":"Section A: Administrative Information","type":"group","readOnly":true,"item":[{"linkId":"Section-36/A0700","prefix":"A0700","text":"Medicaid Number - Enter \"+\" if pending, \"N\" if not a Medicaid recipient","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":14,"id":"item.0.item.0"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0800","prefix":"A0800","text":"Gender","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1,"id":"item.0.item.1"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0900","prefix":"A0900","text":"Birth Date","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"id":"item.0.item.2"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0050","prefix":"A0050","text":"Type of Record","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1,"id":"item.0.item.3"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0250","prefix":"A0250","text":"Reason for Assessment","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2,"id":"item.0.item.4"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0220","prefix":"A0220","text":"Admission Date","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"id":"item.0.item.5"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A1802","prefix":"A1802","text":"Admitted From. Immediately preceding this admission, where was the {patient/resident}?","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2,"id":"item.0.item.6"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0550","prefix":"A0550","text":"{Patient/Resident} ZIP Code.","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":11,"id":"item.0.item.7"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0100","prefix":"A0100","text":"Facility Provider Numbers","type":"group","repeats":false,"readOnly":true,"item":[{"linkId":"Section-36/A0100A","prefix":"A0100A","text":"National Provider Identifier (NPI)","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":10,"id":"item.0.item.8.item.0"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0100B","prefix":"A0100B","text":"CMS Certification Number (CCN)","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12,"id":"item.0.item.8.item.1"}],"id":"item.0.item.8"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500","prefix":"A0500","text":"Legal Name of {Patient/Resident}","type":"group","repeats":false,"readOnly":true,"item":[{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500A","prefix":"A0500A","text":"First name","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12,"id":"item.0.item.9.item.0"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500B","prefix":"A0500B","text":"Middle initial","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1,"id":"item.0.item.9.item.1"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500C","prefix":"A0500C","text":"Last name","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":18,"id":"item.0.item.9.item.2"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0500D","prefix":"A0500D","text":"Suffix","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":3,"id":"item.0.item.9.item.3"}],"id":"item.0.item.9"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0600","prefix":"A0600","text":"Social Security and Medicare Numbers","type":"group","repeats":false,"readOnly":true,"item":[{"linkId":"Section-36/A0600A","prefix":"A0600A","text":"Social Security Number","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":9,"id":"item.0.item.10.item.0"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0600B","prefix":"A0600B","text":"Medicare number","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":12,"id":"item.0.item.10.item.1"}],"id":"item.0.item.10"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A1000","prefix":"A1000","text":"Race/Ethnicity: Check all that apply","type":"text","repeats":true,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1,"id":"item.0.item.11"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A1400","prefix":"A1400","text":"Payer Information: Check all that apply","type":"text","repeats":true,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1,"id":"item.0.item.12"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0205","prefix":"A0205","text":"Site of Service at Admission","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2,"id":"item.0.item.13"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0245","prefix":"A0245","text":"Date Initial Nursing Assessment Initiated","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"id":"item.0.item.14"}],"id":"item.0","description":"The patient must fill out Section A, which pertains to administrative information."},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0700","prefix":"A0700","text":"Medicaid Number - Enter \"+\" if pending, \"N\" if not a Medicaid recipient","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":14,"id":"item.0.item.0","description":"The form asks the patient to enter their Medicaid number. If their Medicaid is still pending, they should enter \"+\". If they are not a Medicaid recipient, they should enter \"N\"."},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0800","prefix":"A0800","text":"Gender","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1,"id":"item.0.item.1","description":"What is the patient's gender? The options are male, female, or prefer not to say."},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0900","prefix":"A0900","text":"Birth Date","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"id":"item.0.item.2","description":"What is the patient's date of birth?"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0050","prefix":"A0050","text":"Type of Record","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1,"id":"item.0.item.3","description":"The type of record for the patient needs to be identified."},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0250","prefix":"A0250","text":"Reason for Assessment","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2,"id":"item.0.item.4","description":"What is the reason for the patient's assessment?"},{"linkId":"Section-36/A0220","prefix":"A0220","text":"Admission Date","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"id":