{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400C","prefix":"Z0400C","text":"Signature, Title, Sections, Date Section Completed C","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100,"id":"item.6.item.0.item.2","description":"The patient needs to provide their signature, title, and complete the sections required on the form. They should also include the date the section was completed, indicated as section C."},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400D","prefix":"Z0400D","text":"Signature, Title, Sections, Date Section Completed D","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100,"id":"item.6.item.0.item.3","description":"The patient filled out the signature, title, and sections, and completed section D on a specific date."},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400E","prefix":"Z0400E","text":"Signature, Title, Sections, Date Section Completed E","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100,"id":"item.6.item.0.item.4","description":"The sections of the form labeled \"Signature\", \"Title\", and \"Date Section Completed E\" should be filled out by the patient."},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400F","prefix":"Z0400F","text":"Signature, Title, Sections, Date Section Completed F","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100,"id":"item.6.item.0.item.5","description":"The form for the patient includes sections for signature, title, and the date when the section was completed."},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400G","prefix":"Z0400G","text":"Signature, Title, Sections, Date Section Completed G","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100,"id":"item.6.item.0.item.6","description":"The patient's signature, title, and the date the section was completed are all required in Section G."},{"linkId":"Section-48/Z0400H","prefix":"Z0400H","text":"Signature, Title, Sections, Date Section Completed H","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":100,"id":"item.6.item.0.item.7","description":"The patient is required to provide their signature and title in 