ng":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9962-7","display":"Current season"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"B","display":"Location of own room"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9998-1","display":"Location of own room"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"C","display":"Staff names and faces"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10085-1","display":"Staff names and faces"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"E","display":"That he or she is in a hospital/hospital unit"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26728-8","display":"That he or she is in a hospital/hospital unit"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"Z","display":"None of the above were recalled"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26729-6","display":"None of the above were recalled"}}],"id":"item.5.item.6"}],"id":"item.5","description":"In Section C of the form, the patient's cognitive patterns are assessed."},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0100","prefix":"C0100","text":"Should Brief Interview for Mental Status be Conducted? Attempt to conduct interview with all {patients/residents}","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"0","display":"No ({patient/resident} is rarely/never understood)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27578-6","display":"No (patient is rarely/never understood)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Yes"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA33-6","display":"Yes"}}],"id":"item.5.item.0","description":"Should a Brief Interview for Mental Status be conducted? It is suggested to attempt to conduct the interview with all patients or residents."},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0200","prefix":"C0200","text":"Repetition of Three Words - Ask {patient/resident}: \"I am going to say three words for you to remember. Please repeat the words after I have said all three. The words are: sock, blue, and bed. Now tell me the three words.\" Number of words repeated after first attempt","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"3","display":"Three"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA6395-3","display":"Three"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"Two"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA6404-3","display":"Two"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"One"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA6306-0","display":"One"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"0","display":"None"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA137-2","display":"None"}}],"id":"item.5.item.1","description":"The form asks the patient, \"I am going to say three words for you to remember. Please repeat the words after I have said all three. The words are: sock, blue, and bed. Now tell me the three words.\" The number of words repeated after the first attempt is then recorded by the medical professional."},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0500","prefix":"C0500","text":"BIMS Summary Score. Add scores for {Brief Interview for Mental Status questions} and fill in total score (00-15). Enter 99 if the {patient/resident} was unable to complete the interview","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2,"id":"item.5.item.2","description":"The BIMS Summary Score should be calculated by adding the scores for the Brief Interview for Mental Status questions and filling in the total score, which ranges from 00 to 15. If the patient or resident was unable to complete the interview, the score to be entered should be 99."},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0600","prefix":"C0600","text":"Should the Staff Assessment for Mental Status be Conducted?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"0","display":"No ({patient/resident} was able to complete Brief Interview for Mental Status)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26843-5","display":"No (patient was able to complete Brief Interview for Mental Status)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Yes ({patient/resident} was unable to complete Brief Interview for Mental Status)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26844-3","display":"Yes (patient was unable to complete Brief Interview for Mental Status)"}}],"id":"item.5.item.3","description":"Should the staff assessment for the patient's mental status be conducted?"},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0300","prefix":"C0300","text":"BIMS: Temporal Orientation (orientation to year, month, and day)","type":"group","repeats":false,"readOnly":true,"item":[{"linkId":"Section-3/C0300A","prefix":"C0300A","text":"Ask {patient/resident}: \"Please tell me what year it is right now.\" Able to report correct year","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"3","display":"Correct"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9960-1","display":"Correct"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"Missed by 1 year"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10008-3","display":"Missed by 1 year"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Missed by 2 - 5 years"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10966-2","display":"Missed by 2-5 years"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"0","display":"Missed by > 5 years or no answer"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10965-4","display":"Missed by > 5 years or no answer"}}],"id":"item.5.item.4.item.0"},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0300B","prefix":"C0300B","text":"Ask {patient/resident}: \"What month are we in right now?\" Able to report correct month","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"Accurate within 5 days"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9927-0","display":"Accurate within 5 days"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Missed by 6 days to 1 month"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10010-9","display":"Missed by 6 days to 1 month"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"0","display":"Missed by > 1 month or no answer"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10969-6","display":"Missed by > 1 month or no answer"}}],"id":"item.5.item.4.item.1"},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0300C","prefix":"C0300C","text":"Ask {patient/resident}: \"What day of the week is today?\" Able to report correct day of the week","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Correct"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9960-1","display":"Correct"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"0","display":"Incorrect or no answer"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9981-7","display":"Incorrect or no answer"}}],"id":"item.5.item.4.item.2"}],"id":"item.5.item.4","description":"The patient's BIMS assessment includes a temporal orientation evaluation, which evaluates their orientation to the current year, month, and day."},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0300A","prefix":"C0300A","text":"Ask {patient/resident}: \"Please tell me what year it is right now.\" Able to report correct year","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"3","display":"Correct"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9960-1","display":"Correct"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"Missed by 1 year"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10008-3","display":"Missed by 1 year"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Missed by 2 - 5 years"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10966-2","display":"Missed by 2-5 years"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"0","display":"Missed by > 5 years or no answer"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10965-4","display":"Missed by > 5 years or no answer"}}],"id":"item.5.item.4.item.0","description":"The form asks the patient or resident, \"Please tell me what year it is right now.\" They are able to report the correct year."},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0300B","prefix":"C0300B","text":"Ask {patient/resident}: \"What month are we in right now?\" Able to report correct month","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"Accurate within 5 days"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9927-0","display":"Accurate within 5 days"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Missed by 6 days to 1 month"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10010-9","display":"Missed by 6 days to 1 month"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"0","display":"Missed by > 1 month or no answer"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10969-6","display":"Missed by > 1 month or no answer"}}],"id":"item.5.item.4.item.1","description":"The form asks the patient or resident, \"What month are we in right now?\" The patient or resident should be able to report the correct month."},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0300C","prefix":"C0300C","text":"Ask {patient/resident}: \"What day of the week is today?\" Able to report correct day of the week","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Correct"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http: