900","prefix":"C0900","text":"Memory/Recall Ability: Check all that the {patient/resident} was normally able to recall","type":"choice","repeats":true,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"A","display":"Current season"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9962-7","display":"Current season"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"B","display":"Location of own room"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9998-1","display":"Location of own room"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"C","display":"Staff names and faces"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10085-1","display":"Staff names and faces"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"E","display":"That he or she is in a hospital/hospital unit"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26728-8","display":"That he or she is in a hospital/hospital unit"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"Z","display":"None of the above were recalled"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26729-6","display":"None of the above were recalled"}}],"id":"item.5.item.6","description":"The patient's or resident's ability to recall normally should be assessed. Please check all that apply."},{"linkId":"Section-37","code":[{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"88482-5","display":"Functional abilities and goals - admission [CMS Assessment]"}],"text":"Section GG: Functional Abilities and Goals","type":"group","readOnly":true,"item":[{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130A1","prefix":"GG0130A1","text":"Eating: The ability to use suitable utensils to bring food and/or liquid to the mouth and swallow food and/or liquid once the meal is placed before the {patient/resident}. - Admission Performance","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by themself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by themself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"s