iologic diagnosis, or comorbid conditions} that meet all the regulatory requirements for {IRF} classification","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"0","display":"No"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA32-8","display":"No"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Yes"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA33-6","display":"Yes"}}],"id":"item.2.item.4"},{"linkId":"Section-41/22","prefix":"22","text":"Etiologic Diagnosis: (Use ICD codes to indicate the etiologic problem that led to the condition for which the {patient/resident} is receiving rehabilitation)","type":"group","repeats":false,"readOnly":true,"item":[{"linkId":"Section-41/22A","prefix":"22A","text":"Etiologic Diagnosis A","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8,"id":"item.2.item.5.item.0"},{"linkId":"Section-41/22B","prefix":"22B","text":"Etiologic Diagnosis B","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8,"id":"item.2.item.5.item.1"},{"linkId":"Section-41/22C","prefix":"22C","text":"Etiologic Diagnosis C","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8,"id":"item.2.item.5.item.2"}],"id":"item.2.item.5"},{"linkId":"Section-41/24","prefix":"24","text":"Comorbid Conditions. Use ICD codes to enter comorbid medical conditions","type":"group","repeats":false,"readOnly":true,"item":[{"linkId":"Section-41/24A","prefix":"24A","text":"Comorbid Condition A","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8,"id":"item.2.item.6.item.0"},{"linkId":"Section-41/24B","prefix":"24B","text":"Comorbid Condition B","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8,"id":"item.2.item.6.item.1"},{"linkId":"Section-41/24C","prefix":"24C","text":"Comorbid Condition C","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":8,"id":"item.2.item.6.item.2"},{"linkId":"Section-41/24D","prefix":"24D","text":"Comorbid Co