ctioning: Everyday Activities. Indicate the {patient's/resident's} usual ability with everyday activities prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury","type":"group","repeats":false,"readOnly":true,"item":[{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0100A","prefix":"GG0100A","text":"Self-Care: Code the {patient's/resident's} need for assistance with bathing, dressing, using the toilet, and eating prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"3","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completed all the activities by themself, with or without an assistive device, with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11539-6","display":"Independent - Patient completed all the activities by themself, with or without an assistive device, with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"Needed Some Help - {Patient/Resident} needed partial assistance from another person to complete any activities."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26832-8","display":"Needed some help - Patient needed partial assistance from another person to complete activities."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Dependent - A helper completed all the activities for the {patient/resident}."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11541-2","display":"Dependent - A helper completed the activities for the patient."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"8","display":"Unknown"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4489-6","display":"Unknown"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"9","display":"Not Applicable"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4720-4","display":"Not applicable"}}],"id":"item.6.item.52.item.0"},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0100B","prefix":"GG0100B","text":"Indoor Mobility (Ambulation): Code the {patient's/resident's} need for assistance with walking from room to room (with or without a device such as cane, crutch, or walker) prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"3","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completed all the activities by themself, with or without an assistive device, with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11539-6","display":"Independent - Patient completed all the activities by themself, with or without an assistive device, with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"Needed Some Help - {Patient/Resident} needed partial assistance from another person to complete any activities."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26832-8","display":"Needed some help - Patient needed partial assistance from another person to complete activities."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Dependent - A helper completed all the activities for the {patient/resident}."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11541-2","display":"Dependent - A helper completed the activities for the patient."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"8","display":"Unknown"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4489-6","display":"Unknown"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"9","display":"Not Applicable"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4720-4","display":"Not applicable"}}],"id":"item.6.item.52.item.1"},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0100C","prefix":"GG0100C","text":"Stairs: Code the {patient's/resident's} need for assistance with internal or external stairs (with or without a device such as cane, crutch or walker) prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"3","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completed all the activities by themself, with or without an assistive device, with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11539-6","display":"Independent - Patient completed all the activities by themself, with or without an assistive device, with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"Needed Some Help - {Patient/Resident} needed partial assistance from another person to complete any activities."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26832-8","display":"Needed some help - Patient needed partial assistance from another person to complete activities."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Dependent - A helper completed all the activities for the {patient/resident}."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11541-2","display":"Dependent - A helper completed the activities for the patient."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"8","display":"Unknown"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4489-6","display":"Unknown"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"9","display":"Not Applicable"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4720-4","display":"Not applicable"}}],"id":"item.6.item.52.item.2"},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0100D","prefix":"GG0100D","text":"Functional Cognition: Code the {patient's/resident's} need for assistance with planning regular tasks, such as shopping or remembering to take medication prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"3","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completed all the activities by themself, with or without an assistive device, with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11539-6","display":"Independent - Patient completed all the activities by themself, with or without an assistive device, with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"Needed Some Help - {Patient/Resident} needed partial assistance from another person to complete any activities."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26832-8","display":"Needed some help - Patient needed partial assistance from another person to complete activities."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Dependent - A helper completed all the activities for the {patient/resident}."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11541-2","display":"Dependent - A helper completed the activities for the patient."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"8","display":"Unknown"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4489-6","display":"Unknown"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"9","display":"Not Applicable"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4720-4","display":"Not applicable"}}],"id":"item.6.item.52.item.3"}],"id":"item.6.item.52"},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130","prefix":"GG0130","text":"Self-Care.","type":"group","repeats":false,"readOnly":true,"item":[{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130_1","prefix":"GG0130_1","text":"Self-Care. Code the {patient's/resident's} usual performance at {admission} for each activity using the 6-point scale. If activity was not attempted at {admission}, code the reason.","type":"group","repeats":false,"readOnly":true,"id":"item.6.item.53.item.0"},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130_2","prefix":"GG0130_2","text":"Self-Care. Code the {patient's/resident's} {discharge} goal(s) using the 6-point scale. Use of codes 07, 09, 10, or 88 is permissible to code {discharge} goal(s).","type":"group","repeats":false,"readOnly":true,"id":"item.6.item.53.item.1"}],"id":"item.6.item.53"},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170","prefix":"GG0170","text":"Mobility.","type":"group","repeats":false,"readOnly":true,"item":[{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170_1","prefix":"GG0170_1","text":"Mobility. Code the {patient's/resident's} usual performance at {admission} for each activity using the 6-point scale. If activity was not attempted at {admission}, code the reason.","type":"group","repeats":false,"readOnly":true,"id":"item.6.item.54.item.0"},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170_2","prefix":"GG0170_2","text":"Mobility. Code the {patient's/resident's} {discharge} goal(s) using the 6-point scale. Use of codes 07, 09, 10, or 88 is permissible to code {discharge} goal(s).","type":"group","repeats":false,"readOnly":true,"id":"item.6.item.54.item.1"}],"id":"item.6.item.54"},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0110","prefix":"GG0110","text":"Prior Device Use. Indicate devices and aids used by the {patient/resident} prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury: Check all that apply","type":"choice","repeats":true,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"A","display":"Manual wheelchair"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA18363-4","display":"Manual wheelchair"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"B","display":"Motorized wheelchair and/or scooter"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26730-4","display":"Motorized wheelchair and/or scooter"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"C","display":"Mechanical lift"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11549-5","display":"Mechanical lift"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"D","display":"Walker"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10117-2","display":"Walker"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"E","display":"Orthotics/Prosthetics"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10046-3","display":"Orthotics/Prosthetics"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"Z","display":"None of the above"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9-3","display":"None of the above"}}],"id":"item.6.item.55"}],"id":"item.6","description":"In Section GG of the form, the patient's functional abilities and goals are documented."},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130A1","prefix":"GG0130A1","text":"Eating: The ability to use suitable utensils to bring food and/or liquid to the mouth and swallow food and/or liquid once the meal is placed before the {patient/resident}. - Admission Performance","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by themself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by themself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"09","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the {patient/resident} did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"10","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"88","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}],"id":"item.6.item.0","description":"The question for the patient or resident is about their eating ability. Specifically, can they use suitable utensils to bring food and/or liquid to their mouth and swallow food and/or liquid once the meal is placed before them? This is in reference to their performance upon admission."},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130B1","prefix":"GG0130B1","text":"Oral hygiene: The ability to use suitable items to clean teeth. Dentures (if applicable): The ability to insert and remove dentures into and from the mouth, and manage denture soaking and rinsing with use of equipment. - Admission Performance","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by themself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by themself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"09","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the {patient/resident} did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"10","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"88","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}],"id":"item.6.item.1","description":"The form asks about the patient's oral hygiene, specifically their ability to use suitable items to clean their teeth. It also inquires if they have dentures and if so, their ability to insert and remove them from the mouth, as well as manage denture soaking and rinsing with the use of equipment. This is relevant to their admission performance."},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130C1","prefix":"GG0130C1","text":"Toileting hygiene: The ability to maintain perineal hygiene, adjust clothes before and after voiding or having a bowel movement. If managing an ostomy, include wiping the opening but not managing equipment. - Admission Performance","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by themself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by themself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"09","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the {patient/resident} did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"10","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"88","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}],"id":"item.6.item.2","description":"The form asks about the patient's ability to maintain perineal hygiene and adjust their clothes before and after voiding or having a bowel movement. If the patient is managing an ostomy, it includes the task of wiping the opening but not managing the equipment. This is pertaining to their performance upon admission."},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130A2","prefix":"GG0130A2","text":"Eating: The ability to use suitable utensils to bring food and/or liquid to the mouth and swallow food and/or liquid once the meal is placed before the {patient/resident}. - Discharge Goal","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by themself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by themself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"09","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the {patient/resident} did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"10","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"88","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}],"id":"item.6.item.3","description":"The discharge goal for the patient is to have the ability to use suitable utensils in order to bring food and/or liquid to their mouth and to be able to swallow food and/or liquid once the meal is placed before them."},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130B2","prefix":"GG0130B2","text":"Oral hygiene: The ability to use suitable items to clean teeth. Dentures (if applicable): The ability to insert and remove dentures into and from the mouth, and manage denture soaking and rinsing with use of equipment. - Discharge Goal","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by themself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by themself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"09","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the {patient/resident} did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"10","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"88","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}],"id":"item.6.item.4","description":"The form inquires about the patient's oral hygiene: their ability to use suitable items to clean their teeth. It also asks if the patient has dentures and if so, it assesses their ability to insert and remove dentures into and from the mouth, and manage denture soaking and rinsing with the use of equipment. The goal is to prepare the patient for discharge."},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130C2","prefix":"GG0130C2","text":"Toileting hygiene: The ability to maintain perineal hygiene, adjust clothes before and after voiding or having a bowel movement. If managing an ostomy, include wiping the opening but not managing equipment. - Discharge Goal","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by themself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by themself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"09","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the {patient/resident} did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"10","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"88","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}],"id":"item.6.item.5","description":"The discharge goal for the patient is related to toileting hygiene, which refers to their ability to maintain perineal hygiene, adjust clothing before and after voiding or having a bowel movement. If they are managing an ostomy, this also includes wiping the opening, but not managing the equipment."},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170A1","prefix":"GG0170A1","text":"Roll left and right: The ability to roll from lying on back to left and right side, and return to lying on back on the bed. - Admission Performance","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by themself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by themself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistan