,"prefix":"GG0185H7","text":"The patient's usual performance in medication management, specifically for oral medications, refers to their ability to prepare and take all prescribed oral medications reliably and safely. This includes administering the correct dosage at the appropriate times or intervals.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0125P","prefix":"GG0125P","text":"Does the patient use an assistive device such as glasses or contact lenses?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Assistive device needed and available - {Patient/Resident} needs this device to complete daily activities and has the device in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30918-9","display":"Assistive device needed and available - Person needs this device to complete daily activities and has the device in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Assistive device needed but current device unsuitable - Device is in home but no longer meets {patient's/resident's} needs."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30919-7","display":"Assistive device needed but current device unsuitable - Device is in home but no longer meets person's needs."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"00","display":"Assistive device needed but not available - {Patient/Resident} needs the device but it is not available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30920-5","display":"Assistive device needed but not available - Person needs the device but it is not available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused - {Patient/Resident} chooses not to use needed device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30921-3","display":"Person refused - Person chooses to not use needed device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not need this device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30922-1","display":"Not applicable - Person does not need this device."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0175I7","prefix":"GG0175I7","text":"The form asks about the patient's ability to wheel for 15 minutes without stopping or resting, such as through a department store or supermarket, while seated in a wheelchair or scooter. Does the patient typically use a motorized wheelchair or scooter for this task?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30909-8","display":"Independent - Person completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30910-6","display":"Setup or cleanup assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; person completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30911-4","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as person completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0125W","prefix":"GG0125W","text":"Does the patient use an assistive device such as a glucometer?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Assistive device needed and available - {Patient/Resident} needs this device to complete daily activities and has the device in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30918-9","display":"Assistive device needed and available - Person needs this device to complete daily activities and has the device in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Assistive device needed but current device unsuitable - Device is in home but no longer meets {patient's/resident's} needs."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30919-7","display":"Assistive device needed but current device unsuitable - Device is in home but no longer meets person's needs."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"00","display":"Assistive device needed but not available - {Patient/Resident} needs the device but it is not available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30920-5","display":"Assistive device needed but not available - Person needs the device but it is not available in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused - {Patient/Resident} chooses not to use needed device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30921-3","display":"Person refused - Person chooses to not use needed device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not need this device."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30922-1","display":"Not applicable - Person does not need this device."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0125T","prefix":"GG0125T","text":"Does the patient use an assistive device such as a lift chair?","type":"choice","repeat