rt. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"09","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the {patient/resident} did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"10","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g. lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"88","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170I2","prefix":"GG0170I2","text":"The discharge goal for the patient is to gain the ability to stand up and walk at least 10 feet in a room, corridor, or similar space once they are standing.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half 