","answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"^","display":"Blank (skip pattern)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"-","display":"Not assessed/no information"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"0","display":"No (enter 0 in column 2)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Yes (enter 0-3 in column 2)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"9","display":"No response (leave column 2 blank)"}}]},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section D. Mood /D0150I2","prefix":"D0150I2","readOnly":false,"text":"Thoughts that you would be better off dead, or of hurting yourself in some way - Symptom Frequency","type":"choice","answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"^","display":"Blank (skip pattern)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"-","display":"Not assessed/no information"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"0","display":"Never or 1 day"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"2-6 days (several days)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"7-11 days (half or more of the days)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"3","display":"12-14 days (nearly every day)"}}]},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section D. Mood /D0160","prefix":"D0160","readOnly":false,"text":"Total Severity Score","type":"integer"},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section D. Mood /D0700","prefix":"D0700","readOnly":false,"text":"Social Isolation. How often do you feel lonely or isolated from those around you?","type":"choice","answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"0","display":"Never"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Rarely"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"Sometimes"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"3","display":"Often"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"4","display":"Always"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"7","display":"{Patient/Resident/Person} declines to respond"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"8","display":"{Patient/Resident/Person} unable to respond"}}]},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section GG. Functional Abilities and Goals/GG0100","prefix":"GG0100","readOnly":false,"text":"Prior Functioning: Everyday Activities. Indicate the patient's usual ability with everyday activities prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury","type":"question"},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section GG. Functional Abilities and Goals/GG0100A","prefix":"GG0100A","readOnly":false,"text":"Self-Care: Code the patient's need for assistance with bathing, dressing, using the toilet, and eating prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury.","type":"choice","answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"-","display":"Not assessed/no information"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Dependent - A helper completed all the activities for the {patient/resident/person}."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"Needed Some Help - {Patient/Resident/Person} needed partial assistance from another person to complete any activities."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"3","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident/Person} completed all the activities by themself, with or without an assistive device, with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"8","display":"Unknown"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"9","display":"Not Applicable"}}]},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section GG. Functional Abilities and Goals/GG0100B","prefix":"GG0100B","readOnly":false,"text":"Indoor Mobility (Ambulation): Code the patient's need for assistance with walking from room to room (with or without a device such as cane, 