oding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"D","display":"Walker"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"E","display":"Orthotics/Prosthetics"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"Z","display":"None of the above"}}]},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section GG. Functional Abilities and Goals/GG0130","prefix":"GG0130","readOnly":false,"text":"Self-Care","type":"question"},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section GG. Functional Abilities and Goals/GG0130_1","prefix":"GG0130_1","readOnly":false,"text":"Self-Care. Code the patient's usual performance at SOC/ROC for each activity using the 6-point scale. If activity was not attempted at SOC/ROC, code the reason.","type":"question"},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section GG. Functional Abilities and Goals/GG0130_2","prefix":"GG0130_2","readOnly":false,"text":"Self-Care. Code the patient's discharge goal(s) using the 6-point scale. Use of codes 07, 09, 10, or 88 is permissible to code discharge goal(s).","type":"question"},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section GG. Functional Abilities and Goals/GG0130_3","prefix":"GG0130_3","readOnly":false,"text":"Self-Care. Code the patient's usual performance at discharge for each activity using the 6-point scale. If any activity was not attempted at discharge, code the reason.","type":"question"},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section GG. Functional Abilities and Goals/GG0130_4","prefix":"GG0130_4","readOnly":false,"text":"Self-Care. Code the patient's usual performance at Follow-Up for each activity using the 6-point scale.  If activity was not attempted at Follow-Up code the reason.","type":"question"},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section GG. Functional Abilities and Goals/GG0130A1","prefix":"GG0130A1","readOnly":false,"text":"Eating: The ability to use suitable utensils to bring food and/or liquid to the mouth and swallow food and/or liquid once the meal is placed before the patient. - Admission Performance","type":"choice","answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"-","display":"Not assessed/no information"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident/Person} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident/person} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds, or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident/person} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident/person} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident/Person} completes the activity by {him/herself/themself} with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident/Person} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"09","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the {patient/resident/person} did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"10","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident/Person} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"88","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical conditions or safety concerns."}}]},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section GG. Functional Abilities and Goals/GG0130A2","prefix":"GG0130A2","readOnly":false,"text":"Eating: The ability to use suitable utensils to bring food and/or liquid to the mouth and swallow food and/or liquid once the meal is placed before the patient. - Discharge Goal","type":"choice","answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"-","display":"Not assessed/no information"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident/Person} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident/person} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds, or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident/person} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding