or hospitalization? Check all that apply","type":"choice","answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"History of falls (2 or more falls - or any fall with an injury - in the past 12 months)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Unintentional weight loss of a total of 10 pounds or more in the past 12 months"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Multiple hospitalizations (2 or more) in the past 6 months"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Multiple emergency department visits (2 or more) in the past 6 months"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Decline in mental, emotional, or behavioral status in the past 3 months"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Reported or observed history of difficulty complying with any medical instructions (for example, medications, diet, exercise) in the past 3 months"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"Currently taking 5 or more medications"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"08","display":"Currently reports exhaustion"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"09","display":"Other risk(s) not listed in 1 - 8"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"10","display":"None of the above"}}]},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section O. Special Treatments, Procedures, and Programs/M1041","prefix":"M1041","readOnly":false,"text":"Influenza Vaccine Data Collection Period: Does this episode of care (SOC/ROC to Transfer/Discharge) include any dates on or between October 1 and March 31?","type":"choice","answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"0","display":"No"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Yes"}}]},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section O. Special Treatments, Procedures, and Programs/M1046","prefix":"M1046","readOnly":false,"text":"Influenza Vaccine Received: Did the patient receive the influenza vaccine for this year's flu season?","type":"choice","answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"^","display":"Blank (skip pattern)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Yes; received from your agency during this episode of care (SOC/ROC to Transfer/Discharge)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Yes; received from your agency during a prior episode of care (SOC/ROC to Transfer/Discharge)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Yes; received from another health care provider (for example, physician, pharmacist)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"No; {patient/resident/person} offered and declined"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"No; {patient/resident/person} assessed and determined to have medical contraindication(s)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"No; not indicated - {patient/resident/person} does not meet age/condition guidelines for influenza vaccine"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"No; inability to obtain vaccine due to declared shortage"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"08","display":"No; {patient/resident/person} did not receive the vaccine due to reasons other than those listed in responses 4 - 7"}}]},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section K. Swallowing/Nutritional Status/M1060","prefix":"M1060","readOnly":false,"text":"Height and Weight. While measuring, if the number is X.1-X.4 round down, X.5 or greater round up","type":"question"},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section K. Swallowing/Nutritional Status/M1060_A","prefix":"M1060_A","readOnly":false,"text":"Height (in inches). Record most recent height measure since the most recent SOC/ROC","type":"integer"},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section K. Swallowing/Nutritional Status/M1060_B","prefix":"M1060_B","readOnly":false,"text":"Weight (in pounds). Base weight on most recent measure in last 30 days; measure weight consistently, according to standard agency practice (for example, in a.m. after voiding, before meal, with shoes off, etc.)","type":"integer"},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section F. Preferences for Customary Routine and Activities/M1100","prefix":"M1100","readOnly":false,"text":"Patient Living Situation: Which of the following best describes the patient's residential circumstance and availability of assistance? (Check one box only.)","type":"choice","answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"{Patient/Resident/Person} lives alone, around the clock assistance available."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"{Patient/Resident/Person} lives alone, regular daytime assistance available."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"{Patient/Resident/Person} lives alone, regular nighttime assistance available."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"{Patient/Resident/Person} lives alone, occasional / short-term assistance available."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"{Patient/Resident/Person} lives alone, no assistance available."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"{Patient/Resident/Person} lives with other person(s) in the home, around the clock assistance available."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident/Person} lives with other person(s) in the home, regular daytime assistance available."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"08","display":"{Patient/Resident/Person} lives with other person(s) in the home, regular nighttime assistance available."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"09","display":"{Patient/Resident/Person} lives with other person(s) in the home, occasional/short-term assistance available."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"10","display":"{Patient/Resident/Person} lives with other person(s) in the home, no assistance available."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"{Patient/Resident/Person} lives in congregate situation (for example, assisted living, residential care home), around the clock assistance available."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"12","display":"{Patient/Resident/Person} lives in congregate situation (for example, assisted living, residential care home), regular daytime assistance available."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"13","display":"{Patient/Resident/Person} lives in congregate situation (for example, assisted living, residential care home), regular nighttime assistance available."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"14","display":"{Patient/Resident/Person} lives in congregate situation (for example, assisted living, residential care home), occasional / short-term assistance available."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"15","display":"{Patient/Resident/Person} lives in congregate situation (for example, assisted living, residential care home), no assistance available."}}]},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section M. Skin Conditions/M1306","prefix":"M1306","readOnly":false,"text":"Does this patient have at least one Unhealed Pressure Ulcer/Injury at Stage 2 or Higher or designated as Unstageable? (Excludes Stage 1 pressure injuries and all healed pressure ulcers/injuries)","type":"choice","answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"0","display":"No"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Yes"}}]},{"repeats":false,"linkId":"Section M. Skin Conditions/M1307","prefix":"M1307","readOnly":false,"text":"The Oldest Stage 2 Press