ining treatments other than Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation was:"},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2200","prefix":"F2200","text":"Hospitalization Preference","type":"group","repeats":false,"readOnly":true,"item":[{"linkId":"Section-47/F2200A","prefix":"F2200A","text":"Was the {patient/resident}/responsible party asked about preference regarding hospitalization? - Select the most accurate response","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1,"id":"item.1.item.2.item.0"},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2200B","prefix":"F2200B","text":"Date the {patient/resident}/responsible party was first asked about preference regarding hospitalization:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"id":"item.1.item.2.item.1"}],"id":"item.1.item.2","description":"The patient has to choose their hospitalization preference."},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2200A","prefix":"F2200A","text":"Was the {patient/resident}/responsible party asked about preference regarding hospitalization? - Select the most accurate response","type":"text","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":1,"id":"item.1.item.2.item.0","description":"Was the patient or the responsible party asked about their preference regarding hospitalization? Please select the most accurate response."},{"linkId":"Section-47/F2200B","prefix":"F2200B","text":"Date the {patient/resident}/responsible party was first asked about preference regarding hospitalization:","type":"open-choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"id":"item.1.item.2.item.1","description":"The date that the patient, resident, or responsible party was first asked about their preference regarding hospitalization was:"},{"linkId":"Section-47/F3000","prefix":"F3000","text":"Spiritual/Existential Concerns","type":"group","repeats":false,"readOnly":true,"item":[{"linkId":"Section-47/F3000A","prefix":"F3000A","text":"Was the {patient/resident} and/or caregiver asked about spiritual/existential concerns? - Select the most accurate response","type":"text","repeats":false,