er. Please repeat the words after I have said all three. The words are: sock, blue, and bed. Now tell me the three words.\" Number of words repeated after first attempt","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"3","display":"Three"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA6395-3","display":"Three"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"Two"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA6404-3","display":"Two"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"One"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA6306-0","display":"One"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"0","display":"None"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA137-2","display":"None"}}],"id":"item.5.item.1","description":"The form asks the patient, \"I am going to say three words for you to remember. Please repeat the words after I have said all three. The words are: sock, blue, and bed. Now tell me the three words.\" The number of words repeated after the first attempt is then recorded by the medical professional."},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0500","prefix":"C0500","text":"BIMS Summary Score. Add scores for {Brief Interview for Mental Status questions} and fill in total score (00-15). Enter 99 if the {patient/resident} was unable to complete the interview","type":"integer","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"maxLength":2,"id":"item.5.item.2","description":"The BIMS Summary Score should be calculated by adding the scores for the Brief Interview for Mental Status questions and filling in the total score, which ranges from 00 to 15. If the patient or resident was unable to complete the interview, the score to be entered should be 99."},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0600","prefix":"C0600","text":"Should the Staff Assessment for Mental Status be Conducted?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{