stance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"09","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the {patient/resident} did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"v