ntly."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA27665-1","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10058-8","display":"Patient refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"09","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the {patient/resident} did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28226-1","display":"Not applicable - Not attempted and the patient did not perform this activity prior to the current illness, exacerbation, or injury."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"10","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g., lack of equipment, weather constraints)"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28227-9","display":"Not attempted due to environmental limitations (e.g. lack of equipment, weather constraints)."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"88","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26735-3","display":"Not attempted due to medical condition or safety concerns"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0100B","prefix":"GG0100B","text":"Please code the patient's or resident's need for assistance with walking from room to room, with or without a device such as a cane, crutch, or walker, prior to their current illness, exacerbation, or injury.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"3","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completed all the activities by him/herself, with or without an assistive device, with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11539-6","display":"Independent - patient completed the activities by him/herself, with or without an assistive device, with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"Needed Some Help - {Patient/Resident} needed partial assistance from another person to complete any activities."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26832-8","display":"Needed some help - patient needed partial assistance from another person to complete activities."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Dependent - A helper completed all the activities for the {patient/resident}."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11541-2","display":"Dependent - a helper completed the activity for the patient."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"8","display":"Unknown"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4489-6","display":"Unknown"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"9","display":"Not Applicable"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA4720-4","display":"Not applicable"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-3/C1610D","prefix":"C1610D","text":"Was the patient's or resident's thinking disorganized or incoherent, characterized by rambling or irrelevant conversation, unclear or illogical flow of ideas, or unpredictable switches from subject to subject?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"0","display":"No"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA32-8","display":"No"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Yes"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA33-6","display":"Yes"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0170J2","prefix":"GG0170J2","text":"The discharge goal for the patient is to attain the ability to stand and walk at least 50 feet, making two turns once they are standing.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11759-0","display":"Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Dependent - Helper does ALL of the effort. {Patient/Resident} does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","cod