liefs, or d) other reasons.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"{Patient/resident} not in facility during this year's influenza vaccination season"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26745-2","display":"Patient not in this facility during this year's influenza vaccination season"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"Received outside of this facility"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA184-4","display":"Received outside of this facility"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"3","display":"Not eligible - medical contraindication"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA11091-8","display":"Not eligible - medical contraindication"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"4","display":"Offered and declined"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA186-9","display":"Offered and declined"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"5","display":"Not offered"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA187-7","display":"Not offered"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"6","display":"Inability to obtain influenza vaccine due to a declared shortage"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA26746-0","display":"Inability to obtain influenza vaccine due to a declared shortage"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"9","display":"None of the above"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9-3","display":"None of the above"}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0130A1","prefix":"GG0130A1","text":"The question on the form refers to the patient or resident's eating abilities, specifically their ability to utilize appropriate utensils to bring food and/or liquid to their mouth and swallow food and/or liquid once the meal is presented to them. This is evaluated based on their admission performance.","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"06","display":"Independent - {Patient/Resident} completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9983-3","display":"Independent - Patient completes the activity by him/herself with no assistance from a helper."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"05","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; {patient/resident} completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10073-7","display":"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"04","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as {patient/resident} completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA28225-3","display":"Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"03","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does LESS THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10055-4","display":"Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.g