es none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the {patient/resident} to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30914-8","display":"Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Person does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the person to complete the activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"07","display":"{Patient/Resident} refused"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30915-5","display":"Person refused."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"11","display":"Not applicable - {Patient/Resident} does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30916-3","display":"Not applicable - Person does not usually do this activity."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"90","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30917-1","display":"Not attempted due to short-term medical condition or safety concerns."}}]},{"linkId":"Section-37/GG0125J","prefix":"GG0125J","text":"Does the patient use an assistive device such as a bed rail?","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"02","display":"Assistive device needed and available - {Patient/Resident} needs this device to complete daily activities and has the device in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA30918-9","display":"Assistive device needed and available - Person needs this device to complete daily activities and has the device in the home."}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"01","display":"Assistive device needed but current device unsuitable - Device is in home but no longer meets {patient's/resident's} needs."}},{"valueCoding":{"s