ing":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10008-3","display":"Missed by 1 year"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Missed by 2 - 5 years"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10966-2","display":"Missed by 2-5 years"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"0","display":"Missed by > 5 years or no answer"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10965-4","display":"Missed by > 5 years or no answer"}}],"id":"item.5.item.4.item.0","description":"The form asks the patient or resident, \"Please tell me what year it is right now.\" They are able to report the correct year."},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0300B","prefix":"C0300B","text":"Ask {patient/resident}: \"What month are we in right now?\" Able to report correct month","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"2","display":"Accurate within 5 days"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA9927-0","display":"Accurate within 5 days"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Missed by 6 days to 1 month"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10010-9","display":"Missed by 6 days to 1 month"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"0","display":"Missed by > 1 month or no answer"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://loinc.org","code":"LA10969-6","display":"Missed by > 1 month or no answer"}}],"id":"item.5.item.4.item.1","description":"The form asks the patient or resident, \"What month are we in right now?\" The patient or resident should be able to report the correct month."},{"linkId":"Section-3/C0300C","prefix":"C0300C","text":"Ask {patient/resident}: \"What day of the week is today?\" Able to report correct day of the week","type":"choice","repeats":false,"readOnly":false,"answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"system":"http://del.cms.gov","code":"1","display":"Correct"}},{"valueCoding":{"system":"http: